hadiths[774]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2950","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apni daadhi lambaai aur chorai sey liya kartey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey huye suna hai : umr bin Harun maqaribul-Hadees hain. main unki koi aisi hadees nahin janta jiski asal na ho, ya ye ke main koi aisi hadees nahin janta jis mein wo munfarid hon, siwaye is hadees key ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apni daadhi ki lambai tool o arz sey kuch letey they. mein usey sirf umr bin Harun ki riwayat sey janta hun. mainey unhen (yani Bukhari ko umr bin Harun) key barey mein achi raey rakhney wala paya hai, 3- mainey Quteba ko umr bin Harun key barey mein kehtey huye suna hai ke umr bin Harun sahab hadees they. aur wo kehtey they ke eman qol o amal ka naam hai, 4- Quteba ney kaha : Wakee bin Jarrah ney mujh sey eik shakhs key wastey sey Sor bin Yazeed sey bayan kya Sor bin Yazeed sey aur soor bin Yazeed riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ehale-taaif par minjneeq nasb kar diya. Quteba kehtey hain mainey (apney ustaad) Wakee bin Jarrah sey puchha ke ye shakhs kon hain? (jinka aap ney abhi riwayat mein (عن"
"2951","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' munchhein kaato aur daadhiyaan badhaao''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2952","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen munchhein katwaaney aur dadhiyan badhaaney ka hukm diya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma key azad karda ghulam abu-Bakar bin Nafey Suqa aadmi hain, 3- umr bin Nafey ye bhi Suqa hain, 4- Abdullah bin Nafey ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma key azad karda ghulam hain aur hadees bayan karney mein zaeef hain."
"2953","unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko masjid main apni eik taang dusri taang par rakh kar chit letey huye dekha . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2954","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum mein sey koi apni peeth key bal letey to apni eik taang dusri taang par na rakhey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko kaee raawiyon ney Suleman (Alaihissalam) Taimi sey riwayat kya hai. aur Khaddash (jinka zikr is hadees ki sanad mein hai) nahin janey jatey ke wo kon hain? aur Suleman (Alaihissalam) Taimi ney un sey kaee hadisein riwayat ki hain."
"2955","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik kapdey mein Sammaa aur Ehtibaa karney aur eik taang dusri taang par rakh kar chit letney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2956","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik shakhs ko apney pet key bal ( ondhey munh ( letaa huwa dekha to farmaya : '' ye aisa letna hai jisey Allah pasand nahin karta''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Yahya bin abi Kasir ney abu-Salma sey riwayat ki hai aur abu-Salma ney Yaeesh bin Tihfa key wastey sey unkey baap Tihfa sey riwayat ki hai, unhen Tikhfa bhi kaha jata hai, lekin sahih Tihfa hi hai. aur baaz Hafiz kehtey hain : Tikhfa sahih hai. aur unhen Tighfa aur Yaeesh bhi kaha jata hai. aur wo Sahaba mein sey hain, padhi. 2- is bab mein Tihfa aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2957","mainey arz kya : Allah key Rasool! hum apni Sharmgaahein kis qadr khol saktey aur kis qadr chupana zaruri hain? aap ney farmaya : ''apni biwi aur apni laundi key siwa har kisi sey apni sharmgaah ko chhipao'', unhoney kaha : aadmi kabhi aadmi key sath mil jal kar rehta hai? aap ney farmaya : ''tab bhi tumhari har mumkin koshish yehi honi chahiye ke tumhari sharmgaah koi na dekh sakey'', mainey kaha : aadmi kabhi tanha hota hai? aap ney farmaya : ''Allah to aur ziyada mustahiq hai ke us sey sharam ki jaey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- Behaz key dada ka naam Muawiya bin Heda al-Qusheri hai. 3- aur Jareeri ney Hakim bin Muawiya sey riwayat ki hai aur wo Behaz key walid hain."
"2958","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne rivayat ki:\n\n\Rasool Allah (ﷺ) apni sawaar (sawaari) par nafil namaz padhte the"
"2959","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne farmaya: \Ya Rasool Allah (ﷺ)! Kaash hum Maqam-e-Ibrahim ke peeche Salaat padh saken.\"" Is par yeh aayat nazil hui: \""Aur Maqam-e-Ibrahim ko Namaz ki jagah banalo.\"" (Surah Al-Baqarah"
"2960","Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Anas (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنہ) ne farmaya: Maine kaha: \Aey Allah ke Rasool (ﷺ)! Main chahta hoon ke aap Maqam-e-Ibrahim ke peeche namaz padhein.\"" Toh yeh aayat nazil hui: \""Aur Maqam-e-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banalo.\"""""
"2961","Abu Sa’eed (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh allh taalyٰ kay frman: \asy trh hm nay tmhyn amtِ wsta bnaya\"" (albqrh: ) kay baray myn nby akrm ﷺ nay frmaya: \""wsta ka many adl w ansaf hay۔\"" abwaysyٰ nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ (dwsry snd) abw sayd (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \""nwh (alyh alslam) kw blaya jayay ga awr pwchha jayay ga: 'kya nay tblygh ky؟' wh khyn gay: 'han'، phr an ky qwm kw blaya jayay ga awr pwchha jayay ga: 'kya as nay tmhyn blaya؟' wh khyn gay: 'hmaray pas kwyy nzyr nhyn aaya، hmaray pas kwyy nhyn aaya۔' phr kha jayay ga: 'tmharay lyay kwn gwahy day ga؟' tw kha jayay ga: 'mhmd ﷺ awr an ky amt۔' aap ﷺ nay frmaya: 'tm layay jao gay takh tm gwahy dw kh as nay tblygh ky، awr yhy allh ka frman hay: \""asy trh...\""'"""
"2962","Hazrat Al-Bara bin 'Azib (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat farmayi ke: \Jab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallah) Madina Munawwara mein pahunche...\"""""
"2963","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Muḥammad ibn Bashshār ne hamein bayān kiya, unhone kaha:** Abū Aḥmad ne hamein riwāyat kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyān ne hamein riwāyat kiya, Ibn Abī Laylā se, uske bhāī ʿĪsā se, ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn Abī Laylā se, aur Abū Ayyūb al-Anṣārī رضي الله عنه se ki unke ek kothrī mein khajūrāt (khajoor) thīṅ, aur ek **ghūl** (jinnāt yā shaiṭān kī ek qism) ā kar us mein se le jātī thī.\n\nUnhone kaha: Toh unhone is bāb mein Nabī ﷺ se shikāyat kī. Nabī ﷺ ne farmāyā: **\Jāo"
"2964","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai: \n\Jab Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne Ka'bah ki taraf rukh karne ka hukum diya"
"2965","Hazrat Zuhri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ne riwayat farmaya ke Hazrat Urqah (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ne kaha ke maine Hazrat Aisha Siddiqah (Radi Allahu Anha) se kaha: \Mujhe koi bura nahi lagta agar koi shakhs Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i na kare.\"""""
"2966","Asim Al-Ahwal ne riwayat ki: \Maine Anas bin Malik (رضی اللہ عنہ) سے As-Safa aur Al-Marwah کے بارے میں پوچھا۔\"""""
"2967","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \jb rswl allh ﷺ mkh myn tshryf layay...\"""""
"2968","Al-Bara bin 'Azib (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \hzrt mhmd (ﷺ) kay shabh kram (rz all anhm) ky rsm yh thy kh...\"""""
"2969","Nu'man bin Bashir (رضي الله عنهما) ne Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se riwayat ki hai ke Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya:\n\n\Tumhare Rab ne farmaya: Mujhse dua karo.\"""""
"2970","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\n\Jab Quran-e-Majeed mein ayat noorani nazil hui:\n\n**'Subah ki saf dhage ko raat ke kale dhage se tumhare liye zaahir hone tak...'**\n\n(Ya'ni Surah Al-Baqarah ki ayat 187 mein jo roza ke akhri waqt ka hukm hai"
"2971","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh myn rswl allh (ﷺ) say rwzay kay baray myn swal kr rha tha۔"
"2972","Hazrat Aslam bin Imran At-Tujibi (Razi Allah unhu) ne riwayat ki ke: \Hum ek Roman sheher mein the.\"""""
"2973","Mujahid ne riwayat kiya ki: Ka'b bin 'Ujrah ne kaha: \Us zat ki qasam jis ke Hath mein meri jan hai! Ayah-e-Karima mere haqeeqat par nazil hua: 'Aur tum mein se jo koi bimar ho ya uske sir mein koi aise bimaari ho jis ke sabab uske sir mundana zaroori ho"
"2974","Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Laila ne riwayat ki hai ke Ka'b bin Ujrah (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) mere paas aap jab main ek bartan ke neeche aag jalata tha...\"""""
"2975","Abdur-Rahman bin Ya'mar (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Hajj hai Arafat.\"""""
"2976","Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) ky rwayt kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \allh kw sb say zyadh mbghz shkhs sb say zyadh jhgralw hay۔\"""""
"2977","**Hadees ka tarjuma (Ilmi Roman Urdu mein):**\n\n**Sahabi ke naam se rawi hain: Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Allah un dono se razi ho):**\n\nRasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab Surah Az-Zilzal (Surah 99) padhi jaye"
"2978","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Yahudi kehte thay: 'Jo shaks apni biwi ke peeth ke zariye uske mein dakhil ho…'\"""""
"2979","# Hadith-e-Surah Al-Ikhlas ka Qur'an ka Ek Hissa Hona\n\n**Awfa ibn Malik** (radiyallahu 'anhu) se marwi hain:\n\nQutaybah aur Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, donon ne kaha: 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Za'idah ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, wo Mansur se, wo Hilal ibn Yasaf se, wo Rabi' ibn Khuthaym se, wo 'Amr ibn Maymun se, wo 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, wo ek aurat se — wo Abu Ayyub ki biwi thi — wo Abu Ayyub (radiyallahu 'anhu) se, unhone kaha:\n\nRasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n**\Kya tum mein se kisi ek shakhs ke liye ek raat mein Qur'an ka ek hissa (taleeq) padhna mumkin nahi hai?\""**\n\nPhir ﷺ ne farmaya: **\""*Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad* (Surah Al-Ikhlas) padhna Qur'an ka ek hissa hai.\""**\n\n---\n\n**Taba'at (Sub-narrators):** Is mauzoo' par Abu al-Darda'"
"2980","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat farmaya ke Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنہ) Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: \Ya Rasool Allah! Main tabah ho gaya!\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Kyun tabah ho gaye?\"" Unhon ne kya: \""Main ne apni sawaari ko raat ke waqt ult kar diya (yani apni biwi ke peeche se haml kiya).\"" Hazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنہما) kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne us par kuch nahi farmaya. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) par yeh aayat nazil farmai: \""Tumhari biwiyan tumhare liye ek kheti hain.\"""""
"2981","Al-Hasan (rhmh allh) nay nql kya kh maql bn ysar (rzy allh anh) nay apny bhn ka nkah rswl allh ﷺ kay zmanh myn mslmanwn myn say ayk shkhs say kr dya۔ wh as kay sath atny dyr rhy jtny dyr rhy۔"
"2982","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Abū Hurayrah (raz̤ī Allāhu ʿanhu) se marwī hai:**\n\nRasūlullāh, ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam, ne farmāyā:\n\n> **\Qul Huwallāhu Aḥad\"" (Sūrah al-Ikhlāṣ"
"2983","Samurah bin Jundab (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hykh allh kay nby (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \drmyany nmaz hy nmaz asr hay۔\"""""
"2984","Ubaidah As-Salmani ne riwayat ki ke Ali (radiyallahu anhu) ne unhen bayan kiya ke Yawm al-Ahzab ke din Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Ya Allah! Unke qabron aur unke gharon mein aag bhar de"
"2985","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hykh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \sla wsty yany asr nmaz hay۔\"""""
"2986","Zaid bin Arqam (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hykh: \rswl allh (ﷺ) kay zmanay myn...\"""""
"2987","Abu Malik ne Al-Bara (rzy allh anh) say rwayt ky kh aayt: \awr as myn say khrab chyz — jw tm khwd asay qbwl krnay kay lyay aankhyn bnd kr kay nhyn lytay — khrch krnay ky nyt nh krw\"" (2:267) — kay baray myn anhwn nay frmaya: \""yh hmaray baray myn nazl hwyy thy۔\"""""
"2988","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \byshk shytan kay aadm kay bytay pr asr hwta hay۔\"""""
"2989","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Aey log! Allah Tayyib (pak aur nek) hai aur woh sirf nek aur pak cheez qubool karta hai. Aur yaqeenan Allah ne mominon ko wahi hukm diya jaisa usne Rasoolon ko hukm diya. Farmaya: 'Aey Rasolon! Halal aur nek cheezein khao aur nek amal karo"
"2990","Mahmud ibn Ghaylan ne hum se rivayat kiya, Abu Dawud ne hum se rivayat kiya, Shu'bah ne hume khabar di, Alqamah ibn Marthad ne kaha: Maine Sa'd ibn Ubaydah ko sunte hue paya ke Abu Abdur Rahman se, Uthman ibn Affan se, ke Rasoolullah ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Tum mein behtareen wo hai jo Quran seekhe aur sikhaye."" Abu Abdur Rahman ne kaha: ""Yehi wajah hai jo mujhe ye maqam (muqarrar jagah) diya."" Aur unhonne Uthman ke zamane mein Quran parhana shuru kiya hatta ke Hajjaj ibn Yusuf tak pahuncha. Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith hasan sahih hai."
"2991","Umayyah ne bayan kiya ke unhone Aisha (رضی اللہ عنہا) سے اللہ تعالیٰ کے فرمان کے بارے میں پوچھا۔"
"2992","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Aur tum apne andar jo kuch bhi khaal ho ya usse chhupa lo...'\"""""
"2993","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne rivayat kiya ke: \Main ne Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Allah Ta'ala ke irshad: 'So...' ke baare mein sawal kiya.\"""""
"2994","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se is aayat ke baare mein poocha gaya: \Wahi hai jisne tum par kitaab nazil ki jismein muhkamaat aayatein hain... (3:7)\"" aayat ke aakhir tak. To Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Jab tum un logon ko dekho jo muhkamaat aayaton ke siwa ghair muhkamaat aayaton ki talash mein hain...\"""""
"2995","**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\nAbdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Har Nabi ke liye Nabiyon mein ek Wali (dost/vali) tha. Mera Wali mera baap Ibrahim hain"
"2996","Hazrat Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne kisi Musalmaan ki maal ki haq baatil karne ke liye jhoothi qasam khaaee...\"""""
"2997","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\n\Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Tum qasdan birr (nekī) hasil nahi kar sakte jab tak apne pasandeeda cheezon mein se kharch na karo' (Surah Aal-e-Imran"
"2998","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai:\n\n\Aik aadmi Nabi ﷺ ke saamne khada hua aur poocha: 'Hajja kaun hai?'\"""""
"2999","Hazrat 'Amir bin Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas RadiAllahu Anhu ne apne walid Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas RadiAllahu Anhu se riwayat farmaya ke jab yeh aayat nazil hui: \Aao...\"""""
"3000","Abu Ghalib ne riwayat kiya ke: Abu Umamah (ra) ne Dimashq ke gharon par Khawarij ke sar latkaye hue dekhe. Unhon ne kaha: \Jahannam ke kutte hain"
"3001","Muḥammad ibn Ismāʿīl al-Wāsiṭī ne ham ko ḥadīth sunā aur farmāyā: Wakīʿ ne ham ko ḥadīth sunā aur farmāyā: Abū Farwah Yazīd ibn Sinān ne ham ko ḥadīth sunā, al-Mubārak se riwāyat kī, Ṣuhayb se, unhone farmāyā: Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: \Usne Qurʾān par īmān nahin lāyā jisne uske ḥarām ko ḥalāl kar liyā.\""\n\nAbū ʿIsā ne farmāyā: Is ḥadīth ke sanad mein ḍāfuʿat hai"
"3002","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Al-Hasan ibn 'Arafah ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha:** Isma'il ibn 'Ayyash ne hamain Bahir ibn Sa'd se riwayat ki, Bahir ne Khalid ibn Ma'dan se, Khalid ne Kathir ibn Murrah al-Hadrami se, aur Kathir ne 'Uqbah ibn 'Amir se riwayat ki, unhone kaha:\n\n**\Main Rasool Allah ﷺ ko farmaate suna:**\n\n**'Jo shakhs Qur'an-e-Majeed ko zaahiree tilaawat karey"
"3003","Hadees ke mutabiq Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ka chehra zakhmi ho gaya tha.\"""""
"3004","Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar (radi Allahu anhu) ne apne walid Abdullah bin Umar (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke: \Yawm-e-Uhud ke din...\"""""
"3005","Abdullah bin Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) chaar logon ke khilaf dua kar rahe the.\"""""
"3006","Asma bin Al-Hakam Al-Farazi (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke maine Ali (رضي الله عنه) ko yeh kehte suna ke: \Beshak main ek aisa aadmi hoon jo...\"""""
"3007","Hadees ke mutabiq, Anas (raziya Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Abu Talhah (raziya Allahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Main ne Uhud ke din apna sar uthakar chaaron taraf dekha.\"""""
"3008","# hdys \n\n**jabr bn abdallh (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn:**\n\n> nby akrm (sly allh alyh wslm) mwqf myn apnay aap pysh krtay awr frmatay: *\kwyy aysa shkhs nhyn jw mjhay apny qwm kay pas phncha day؟ kywnkh qrysh nay mjhay apnay rb ky bat phnchanay say rwk dya hay\""*\n\n**abw aysyٰ (trmzy) frmatay hyn:** yh ghryb shyh hdys hay\n\n---\n\n### almy hwashh:\n\n- **asman bn mghyrh** salm bn aby aljad say، awr wh jabr bn abdallh (rzy allh anh) say rwayt krtay hyn، jw shabh kram myn say ayk mmtaz shaby awr bht sy ahadys kay rawy hyn\n- yh jmlh yany nby akrm (sly allh alyh wslm) hj kay mwsm awr mwaqf myn qbayl kw apna aap pysh krtay thay، ayk aysay hamy ky jstjw krtay thay jw anhyn apnay rb ky pygham phnchanay ky ajazt day\n- **\""kwyy aysa shkhs nhyn jw mjhay apny qwm kay pas phncha day؟\""** — as say nby akrm (sly allh alyh wslm) ky yh shdyd khwahsh zahr hwty hay kh kwyy aysy jmaat mlay jw an ky dawt qbwl kray awr anhyn pnah frahm kray\n- **\""kywnkh qrysh nay mjhay apnay rb ky bat phnchanay say rwk dya hay\""** — as say mrad mkh mkrmh myn qrysh ky shdyd azyt hay، js nay nby akrm (sly allh alyh wslm) ky alhy pygham phnchanay ky mhm myn rkawt dal dy thy\n- **\""yh ghryb shyh hdys hay\""** — abw aysyٰ trmzy (rhm allh alyh) nay as hdys kw ghryb (as ky snd myn nadr) awr shyh (mstnd) qrar dya hay، js say mrad yh hay kh agrchh as ky snd ykhy hay، mgr wh mstnd hwnay kay mayar pr pwry atrty hay۔"""
"3009","Khusaif ne riwayat ki, Miqsam se, aur Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne farmaya: \Yeh aayat: 'Kisi Nabi ke liye yeh jaaiz nahi hai ke ghanimat ka kisi hissa baghair haq ke le jaye…' (Surah Aal-e-Imran"
"3010","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo shakhs har din do so martaba « قل هو الله أحد » padheyga to qarz key siwa uskey pachas saal tak key gunah mita diye jaeyngey''."
"3011","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : « قل هو الله أحد » eik tihai Quran key barabar hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"3012","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum sab ikhattey ho jaao kyonkey main tum sab ko tihai Quran padh kar sunaney wala hun.''  chunanche aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki. is pukar par jo bhi pahunch saka jama ho gaya, phir Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam bahar tashrif laye, Sura « قل هو الله أحد » padhi aur (hujrae shareef mein) wapis chaley gaey. to baaz Sahaba ney che-mein-goiyaan kartey huye kaha : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya tha : main anqarib tumhen tihai Quran padh kar sunaaunga, mera khayal ye hai ke aisa us wajeh sey huwa hai ke aasman sey koi khabar (koi ittilaa) aa gaee hai, phir Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam kamrey sey bahar nikley aur farmaya : ''main ney kaha tha main tumhen tihai Quran padh kar sunaaunga to sun lo ye Sura « قل هو الله"
"3013","Masjide Qubaa main eik Ansari shakhs un ki imaamat karta tha, aur uski aadat ye thi ke jab bhi wo irada karta ke koi sura namaz mein padhey to usey padhta lekin is sura sey pehley « قل هو الله أحد » puri padhta , phir uskey sath dusri sura padhta , aur wo ye amal har rakat mein karta tha. to uskey sathiyon (namaaziyon) ney us sey (is mauzoo par) baat ki, unhoney kaha : aap ye sura padhtey hain phir aap khayal kartey hain ke ye to aap key liye kafi nahin hai yahan tak ke dusri sura (bhi) padhtey hain, to aap ya to sirf isey padhein, ya isey chhod den aur koi dusri sura padhein, to unhoney kaha : main isey chhodney wala nahin, agar aap log pasand karen ke main isey padhney key sath sath imaamat karun to imaamat karunga aur agar aap log iskey sath imaamat kaarna pasand nahin kartey to main aap logon (ki imaamat) ko chhod dunga. aur logon ka haal ye tha ke unhen apnon mein sab sey afzal samajhtey they aur napasand kartey they ke unkey siwa koi doosra un ki imaamat karey, chunanche Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab un logon key paas aaye to unhoney aap ko sari baat batai. aap ney farmaya : ''aey falan ! tumharey sathi jo baat keh rahey hain, is par amal karney sey tumhen kya chiz rok rahi hai aur tumhen kya chiz majbur kar rahi hai ke har rakat main tum is sura ko padho?''  unhoney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! main isey pasand karta hun, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''iski mohabbat tumhen jannat mein ley jaeygi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib sahih hai aur ye Ubedullah bin umr ki riwayat sey hai jisey wo Sabit sey riwayat kartey hain."
"3014","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah Taala ney mujh par aisi aayaat nazil ki hain jaisi ( kabhi ( nahin dekhi gaee hain, wo ye hain : « قل أعوذ برب الناس » aakhir Sura tak aur « قل أعوذ برب"
"3015","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujhey hukm diya ke har namaz key baad muawwizatain padha karun. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"3016","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs Quran padhta hai aur Quran padhney mein maharat rakhta hai wo buzurg pakbaz farishton key sath hoga, aur jo shakhs Quran padhta hai aur badi mushkil sey padh paata hai, padhna usey bahut shaaq guzartaa hai to usey dohra ajr milega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"3017","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney Quran padha aur usey puri tarah hifz kar liya, jis chiz ko Quran ney halal thehraya usey halal jana aur jis chiz ko Quran ney haram thehraya usey haram samjha to Allah usey is Quran key zariey jannat mein dakhil farmaeyga. aur uskey khaandaan key das aisey logon key barey mein is (Quran) ki sifarish qubul karega jin par jahannam wajib ho chuki hogi.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, isey hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- iski sanad sahih nahin hai. 3- Hafs bin Suleman (Alaihissalam) hadees mein zaeef qarar diye gaey hain."
"3018","masjid mein gaya to kya dekhta hun ke log gap-shap aur qisse kahaniyon mein mashghool hain, main Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key paas pahuncha. mainey kaha : Ameerul-Momineen ! kya aap dekh nahin rahey hain ke log faaltu baaton mein padey huye hain?  unhoney kaha : kya waqae wo aisa kar rahey hain? mainey kaha : haan , unhoney kaha : magar mainey to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna hai : ''anqareeb koi fitna barpa hoga.''  mainey kaha is fitna sey bachney ki surat kya hogi? Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : ''kitabullah , is main tum sey pehley key logon aur qomon ki khabren hain aur baad key logon ki bhi khabren hain, aur tumharey darmiyan key umoor aur maamlat ka hukm aur faisla bhi is mein mojud hai, aur wo do tok faisla karney wala hai, hansi mazaq ki chiz nahin hai. jisney isey sarkashi sey chhod diya Allah usey tod dega aur jo isey chhod kar kahin aur hidayat talash kerega Allah usey gumrah kar dega. wo (Quran) Allah ki mazbut rassi hai ye wo hikmat bhara zikr hai, wo sidha raasta hai, wo hai jiski wajeh sey khuwahishen idhar udhar nahin bhatak paati hain, jiski wajeh sey zabanen nahin ladkhadaatin, aur ulama ko (chahey kitna hi isey padhein) ji nahi bharta, iskey baar-baar padhney aur takraar sey bhi wo puraanaa (aur be maza) nahin hota. aur iski anokhi (aur qeemti) baaten khatam nahin hotin, aur wo Quran wo hai jisey sun kar jin khamosh na reh sakey balke pukar uthey : hamney eik ajeeb (anokha) Quran suna hai jo bhalai ka raasta dikhata hai, to hum is par eman ley aaye, jo uskey mutabiq boleyga uskey mutabiq amal kerega usey ajr aur sawab diya jaeyga. aur jisney iskey mutabiq faisla kiya usney insaf kiya aur jisney iski taraf bulaya usney  sidhey raastey ki hidayat di. Aa'war ! in achchhi baaton ka khayal rakho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, is hadees ko hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- iski sanad majhool (anjaan) hai. 3- Haris key barey mein kalam kiya gaya hai."
"3019","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum mein sey behtar wo shakhs hai jo Quran seekhey aur sikhlaaye.'' abu-Abdur-Rehman Sulami (Raavi hadees) kehtey hain : yehi wo chiz hai jisney mujhey apni is nashist gaah (musnad) par bitha rakha hai, Usman key zamaney mein Quran ki taalim deni shuru ki (aur detey rahey) yahan tak Hujjaaj bin Yusuf key zamaney mein ye silsila chalta raha.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"3020","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum mein sab sey behtar ya tum mein sab sey afzal wo shakhs hai jo Quran seekhey aur sikhlaey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Abdur-Rehman bin Mehdi aur kaee dusron ney isi tarah basanad (سفيان الثوري an علقمة بن مرثد an أبي عبدالرحمٰن an عثمان an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai, 3- Sufiyan iski sanad mein Saad bin Ubeda ka zikr nahin kartey hain, 4- Yahya bin Saeed Qataan ney ye hadees basanad (سفيان وشعبة an علقمة بن مرثد an سعد بن عبيدة an أبي عبدالرحمٰن an عثمان an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"3021","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum mein sab sey behtar wo shakhs hai jo Quran seekhey aur sikhlaey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is hadees ko hum Ali bin abi Talib ki riwayat sey jisey wo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain sirf Abdur-Rehman bin Is-haq ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"3022","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney kitabullah ka eik harf padha usey uskey badley eik neki milegi, aur eik neki das guna badha di jaeygi, main nahin kehta « Alif-Lam-Mim » eik harf hai, balke «Alif» eik harf hai, « Lam » eik harf hai aur « Mim » eik harf hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad key ilawa dusri sanad sey bhi ibne-Masood sey riwayat ki gaee hai, 2- is hadees ko Abul-Ahwas ney ibne-Masood sey riwayat kya hai. baaz ney isey marfooan riwayat kya hai aur baaz ney isey ibne-Masood sey moqufan riwayat kya hai, 3- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"3023","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah Taala kisi bandey ki koi baat itni ziyada tawajjoh aur yaksu ho kar nahin sunta jitni do rakatein padhney waley bandey ki sunta hai, aur banda jab tak namaz padh raha hota hai uskey sar par neki ki barish hoti rehti hai, aur bandey Allah azz-w-jall sey) kisi chiz sey) utna qarib nahin hotey jitna us chiz sey jo uski zaat sey nikli hai'', abu-Nazar kehtey hain : aap us qol sey Quran murad letey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai aur hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, 2- Bakr bin Khunes key barey mein ibne-Mubarak ney kalam kya hai aur aakhir Amr yani baad mein (unkey zaeef honey ki wajeh sey) un sey riwayat kerni chhod di thi, 3- ye hadees Zaid bin Irtaat key wastey sey Juber bin Nufer sey marvi hai unhoney Nabi karim Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursal tareeq sey riwayat ki hai."
"3024","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum Allah ki taraf ruju karney key liye Quran sey badh kar koi aur zariey nahin paa saktey ''."
"3025","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''wo shakhs jis key dil mein Quran ka kuch hissa yad na ho wo wiran ghar ki tarah hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"3026","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' (qiyamat key din) sahibe-Quran sey kaha jaeyga : ( Quran ( padhta ja aur) bulandi ki taraf ( chadhta ja. aur wesey hi thehar thehar kar padh jis tarah to duniya mein thehar thehar kar tarteel key sath padhta tha. pas teri manzil wo hogi jahan teri aakhiri aayat ki tilawat khatam hogi '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"3027","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Quran qiyamat key din pesh hoga pas kahega : aey merey rab ! usey ( yani sahibe-Quran ko) joda pahna, to usey karaamat ( izzat o sharafat (ka taaj pehnaya jaeyga. phir wo kaheyga : aey merey rab! usey aur dey, to usey karaamat ka joda pehnaya jaeyga. wo phir kaheyga : aey merey rab us sey razi o khush ho ja, to wo us sey razi o khush ho jaeyga. us sey kaha jaeyga padhta ja aur chadhta ja, terey liye har aayat key sath eik neki ka izafa kya jata rahega ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"3028","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''meri ummat key nek aamal key ajr o sawab merey samney pesh kiye gaey yahan tak ke us tinkey ka sawab bhi pesh kya gaya jisey aadmi masjid sey nikal kar phenk deta hai. aur mujh par meri ummat key gunah ( bhi) pesh kiye gaey to mainey koi gunah us sey badh kar nahin dekha ke kisi ko Quran ki koi Sura ya koi aayat yad ho aur usney usey bhula diya ho ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- is hadees ko hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, 3- mainey is hadees ka tazkira Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey kya to isko wo pehchan na sakey aur unhoney is hadees ko gharib qarar diya, 4- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ney ye bhi kaha ke main nahin janta ke Muttalib bin Abdullah ki kisi Sabab Rasool sey sama Sabit hai, siwaye Muttalib key us qol key ke mujh sey us shakhs ney riwayat ki hai jo Nabi karim Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki haazirin mein mojud tha, 5- mainey Abdullah bin Abdur-Rehman ( Darmi ( ko kehtey huye suna hai ke hum Muttalib ka samaa, kisi Sabab Rasool sey nahin jantey , 6- Abdullah ( Darmi ye bhi) kehtey hain : Ali bin Madini is baat ka inkar kartey hain ke Muttalib ney Anas sey suna hai."
"3029","wo eik qissa bhale hi key paas sey guzrey jo Quran padh raha tha ( padh kar) wo maangney laga . to unhoney (إنا لله وإنا إليه راجعون) padha , phir kaha : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko kehtey huye suna hai jo Quran padhey to usey Allah hi sey maangna chahiye . kyonkey anqarib kuch log aisey ayengey jo Quran padh-padh kar logon sey maangengey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, iski sanad wesi qawi nahin hai, 2- Mehmood bin Ghelaan kehtey hain : ye khaisma Basra hain jin sey Jabir Jaafi ney riwayat ki hai. ye khaisma bin Abdur-Rehman nahin hain. aur khaisma Shekh Basra hain unki kunniyat Abu-Nasar hai aur unhoney Anas bin Malik sey kaee hadisein riwayat ki hain. aur Jabir Jaafi ney bhi khaisma sey kaee hadisein riwayat ki hain."
"3030","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney Quran ki haram ki hui chizon ko halal jana wo Quran par eman nahin rakhta ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ki sanad ziyada qawi nahin hai, Wakee ki riwayat mein Wakee sey ikhtilaf kya gaya hai, 2- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain : Abu-Farwa kehtey hain : Yazeed bin Sanan Rahawi ki riwayat leney mein koi harj nahin hai. siwaye us riwayat key jisey unkey betey Muhammad un sey riwayat kartey hain, isliye ke wo unsey munkar riwayat kartey hain, 3- Muhammad bin Yazeed bin Sanan ney apney baap sey ye hadees bhi riwayat ki hai aur iski sanad mein itna izafa kya hai : (عن مجاهد an سعيد بن المسيب an"
"3031","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna hai : '' buland aawaz sey Quran padhney wala aisa hai jaisa khuley aam sadqa deney wala , aur aahisatagi o khamoshi sey Quran padhney wala aisa hai jaisey chupa kar sadqa deney wala ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- is hadees ka maana o matlab ye hai ke jo shakhs aahisatagi sey Quran padhta hai wo us shakhs sey afzal hai jo buland aawaz sey Quran padhta hai, isliye ke ehle-ilm key nazdik chupa kar sadqa dena barsarey-aam sadqa deney sey afzal hai. mafhoom ye hai ke ehle-ilm key nazdik us sey aadmi ajab (khudnumaai) sey mehfooz rehta hai. kyonkey jo shakhs chupa kar amal karta hai uskey ajab mein padney ka itna khatra nahin hai jitna uskey khuley aam amal karney mein hai."
"3032","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab tak Sura bani-Israel aur Sura Zumar padhna letey bistar par sotey na they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- abu-Lubaba eik Basra Shekh hain, Hammad bin Zaid ney un sey kaee hadisein riwayat ki hain, kaha jata hai ke unka naam Marwan hai, ye baat mujhey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ney kitabut-Tarikh mein batai hai."
"3033","Ya'la bin Umayyah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn:\n\nmyn nay amr bn khtab (rzy allh anh) say kha: \allh taalyٰ frmata hay: agr tmhyn khwf tha awr lwg mhfwz thay tw tm nmaz kw mkhtsr kr dw (4:101)۔\"" tw amr (rzy allh anh) nay kha: \""myn nay bhy as kay baray myn why tajb kya hay jw tm nay kya hay۔ tw myn nay as ka zkr rswl allh (ﷺ) say kya۔\"""""
"3034","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Dajnan aur Usfan ke dauran qayaam farmaya."
"3035","Qatadah bin An-Nu'man (Radiyallahu 'Anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Hamare darmiyan ek khaandaan thi jiska naam Banu Ubairiq tha.\"""""
"3036","Thuwair - Ibn Abi Fakhitah ne apni rivayat mein apne walid se naql farmaya ke Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (radi Allahu anho) ne farmaya: \Qur'an-e-Majeed mein koi aisi aayat nahin mujh se ziyada mahboob jis ki misal yeh ho ke: Beshak Allah Ta'ala kisi ko shareek thehrane ki muaaf nahin farmata.\"""""
"3037","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya: \n\Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Jo bhi bura'amal karega"
"3038","Abu Bakr Siddiq (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya: Main Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke saath tha jab yeh aayat un par nazil hui: \Jo burai kaam karega usi ka badla milega\"" (4:123). To Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""A Abu Bakr! Kya main tumhein woh aayat suna doon jo mujhe nazil ki gayi hai?\"" Maine kaha: \""Bilkul"
"3039","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai: \n\Sawdah (رضي الله عنها ne) ko andesha tha ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) unhe talaq de denge.\"""""
"3040","Abd ibn Humayd ne humein riwayat ki, Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar se, Hammam ibn Munabbih se, Abu Hurairah (radhiAllahu anhu) se, unhone farmaya: RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ne Unke (Subhanahu wa Ta'ala) kalame \Darwaze mein sajde ki halat mein dakhil ho jao\"" (Quran 2:58) ke mutalliq farmaya: \""Woh apni potlon par ghiste hue dakhil hue.\"" Aur isi sanad se Nabi (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) se Unke kalame \""Lekin zalim logon ne un baat ko badla jo unhein kahi gayi thi\"" (Quran 2:59) ke mutalliq riwayat hai"
"3041","Hazrat Al-Bara (Razi Allah unhu) se riwayat hai:\n\nEk shakhs Rasool Allah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: \Ya Rasool Allah! Woh aap se ek fatwa ka sawal karte hain. Farmayen: 'Allah Ta'ala ne Al-Kalalah (Surah An-Nisa"
"3042","Tariq bin Shihab ne riwayat kiya ke: \Yahudi aadmi ne 'Umar bin Al-Khattab (RadiAllahu Anh) se kaha: 'Aaye Amir-ul-Mu'minin! Agar yeh aayat hamare par utri hoti...'\"""""
"3043","Abd ibn Humayd ne humein riwayat ki, al-Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne riwayat ki, Hammad ibn Salamah ne Humayd se riwayat ki, Humayd ne Anas رضي الله عنه se riwayat ki ke Umar رضي الله عنه ne farmaya: \Ya Rasool Allah ﷺ"
"3044","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ar-Rahman ka dahi haath bhara hua hai.\"""""
"3045","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat farmaya: \Hazrat Muhammad (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki hifaazat ki ja rahi thi"
"3046","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb bny asrayyl nay nafrmany ky\"""""
"3047","Abu Ubaidah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb bny asrayyl zwal kay ghtnay lgay\"""""
"3048","**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\n**Riwayat hai 'Amr bin Shurahbil (Abu Maisarah) radiAllahu 'anhu se, ki unhone 'Umar bin Al-Khattab radiAllahu 'anhu se naqal farmaya.**"
"3049","Al-Bara (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke Sahaba mein se ek shakhs is se pehle wafat paaya ke sharab (khamr) haraam hone se pehle. Phir jab sharab (khamr) haraam kar diya gaya..."
"3050","Al-Bara bin Azid (Razi Allah unhu) ne riwayat ki: \Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ke kuch Sahaaba (Razi Allah unhum) intiqal farma chuke hain jabke woh Khamr (sharab) peete thain. Phir jab yeh hukm nazil hua ke Khamr haraam hai...\"""""
"3051","Ibn Abbas (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay: shabh kram (rzwan allh alym ajmayn) nay arz kya: \ya rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm)!\"""""
"3052","Abdullah (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: \Jo log iman lae aur neik amal karein...\"""""
"3053","Ikrimah ne Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat ki ke ek shakhs Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke hazur mein aaya aur arz kiya: \Ya Rasoolallah! Jab main goshaat khaata hoon aur auraton ke paas jaata hoon...\"""""
"3054","Abu Al-Bukhtari ne riwayat ki: se Ali (رضی اللہ عنہ) ne farmaya: \جب (یہ آیت) نازل ہوئی: اور خانہِ کعبہ کا حج انسانوں پر اللہ کی طرف سے فرض ہے۔\"""""
"3055","Hadees ka tarjuma ilmi aur adabi Roman Urdu mein:\n\nHazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh ayk shkhs nay arz ky: \ya rswl allh! myra bap kwn hay؟\"" aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""tmhara bap flan hay۔\"" as shkhs nay kha: \""phr yh aayt nazl hwyy: aay ayman walw! aysy batwn kay baray myn mt pwchhw jw...\"""""
"3056","Abu Bakr Siddiq (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Aey log! Tum yeh aayat padhte ho: 'Apni hifazat karo! Agar tum hidayat par chaloge to gumrah log tumhe nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakte' (5:105). Main ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmate suna hai ke jab log zaalim ko dekhte hain aur use rokte nahi"
"3057","Abu Umayah Sha'bani ne riwayat ki: \Main Abu Tha'balah Khushani ke paas aaya aur unse kaha: 'Aap is Aayat ka kya hukm rakhte hain?' Unhon ne kya: 'Kaunsi Aayat?' Maine kaha: 'Allah Ta'ala ka farmaan: Apni hifazat khud karo! Agar tum hidayat par chaloge to tumhe koi nuqsan nahin hoga (5:105).' Unhon ne kaha: 'Achchha...'\"""""
"3058","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Ka'b ibn 'Ujrah (razAllahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya:**\n\nUnhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ke haan maine ek tashtari ke neeche aag bhaad rahi thi, aur mere maathhe par — ya unhon ne kaha, mere abruon par — jeen gir rahi thi. Toh unhon ne (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) farmaya: **\Kya tere sar ke kante tujhe dard pahunchate hain?\""**\n\nUnhon ne kaha: Maine jawaab diya"
"3059","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Razi Allah unhu) se riwayat hai: \Banu Sahm ka ek aadmi Tamim Ad-Dari aur Adi bin Badda (Razi Allah unhum) ke saath safar par nikla. Woh Sahmi shakhs aisi zindagi guzar kar gaya jahan koi Musalman maujood na tha. Jab woh uski tarka (maal) lekar wapas aaye...\"""""
"3060","Ammar bin Yasir (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyk kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \maydh aasman say rwty awr gwsht kay sath atara gya awr anhyn hkm dya gya kh as myn khyant nh kryn awr nh asay kl kay lyay chhpayyn۔ lykn anhwn nay as myn khyant ky awr chhpa dya۔\"""""
"3061","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\nAbd ibn Humayd ne hamse riwayat ki, Sulaymān ibn Ḥarb ne mujhe riwayat ki, Ḥammād ibn Salamah ne humse riwayat ki Thābit se, aur Thābit ne Anas رضي الله عنه se riwayat kiya, unhone farmaya:\n\n\Yahoodiyon ke paas jab unki koi aurat haiz (mahwāri) aati"
"3062","Abdullah bin Amr (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai keh: \Aakhri surah jo nazil hui Surah Al-Ma'idah aur Al-Fath hai.\"""""
"3063","Hazrat Ali (Razi Allahu Anho) ne riwayat farmaya ke Hazrat Muhammad (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Abu Jahl ne kaha: \Hum aap ko mukarrar nahi karte\"""""
"3064","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: jb allh taalyٰ nay yh aayt nazl frmayy: \khh dw: wh as pr qadr hay kh tm pr awpr say azab bhyjay ya tmhary tkhnwn kay nychay say...\"" tw nby krym ﷺ nay frmaya: \""myn tyray chhray ky pnah mangta hwn۔\"" phr jb yh aayt nazl hwyy: \""ya tmhyn mkhtlf grwhwn myn tqsym kr day...\"""""
"3065","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Riwayat farmaya 'Abd ibn Humayd** — ne — jinhone farmaya: **Hisham ibn al-Qasim** ne hamse riwayat ki — **al-Mubarak ibn Fadalah** se — **al-Hasan** se — **Ma'qil ibn Yasar** (RaziAllahu Anhu) se:\n\n---\n\nKi unhone apni ek behan ko Musalmanon mein se ek mard se nikah kar diya RasoolAllah ﷺ ke zamane mein. Woh uske saath kuch arsa rahe, phir usne ek talaq de di aur usse wapas nahi liya jab tak uski 'iddat mukammal nahi ho gayi. Phir us mard aur us aurat dono mein ek doosre ke liye mohabbat paida ho gayi. Baad mein us mard ne doosre khawand ke saath uski nikah ki khidmat ki. Ma'qil (RaziAllahu Anhu) ne us se kaha: \Ai badbakht! Maine tujhe izzat di thi ke tujhse uska nikah kar diya"
"3066","**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\nHazrat Abdullah (raziya Allahu anho) ne bayan farmaya: \Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Woh log jo iman laaye aur apne iman par zulm (zulm) nahi lagaye' (Surah Al-An'aam"
"3067","Hazrat Masruq (Razi Allah unhu) ne riwayat farmaya ke main Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah unha) ki hazoori mein takiya lagaye baitha tha to unhone farmaya: \Aye Abu Aisha! Aise teen aise amal hain"""
"3068","Abdullah bin Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke: Kuch log Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas aaye aur unhone kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Hum apne qatl kiye hue jaanwar kha lekin Allah ke qatl kiye hue nahi kha sakte?\"" Toh Allah Ta'ala ne yeh aayat nazil ki: \""Us cheez ko khao jis par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho"
"3069","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ne Muhammad (ﷺ) ke us Sahifah par nishan (muhr) lagaya tha"
"3070","# Hadith ka Tarjama\n\n**Zayd ibn Arqam (Razi Allah Ta'ala Anhu) rivayat kiya:**\n\nAhmad ibn Mani' ne hamen rivayat kiya, kiha: Marwan ibn Mu'awiyah, Yazid ibn Harun, aur Muhammad ibn 'Ubaid ne hamen rivayat kiya, Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid se, al-Harith ibn Shubayl se, Abu 'Amr al-Shaybani se, Zayd ibn Arqam (Razi Allah Ta'ala Anhu) se, jo kiha:\n\n**\Humein ṣalāt ke duroone bolne ki ijāzat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ke zamane mein thī"
"3071","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \tyn hyn aysay\"""""
"3072","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne...\"""""
"3073","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai aur uska farman bar-haq (aur durust) hai : jab mera banda kisi neki ka qasd (irada) aur irada kerey. to (merey farishto !) uskey liye neki likh lo, aur agar wo us bhaley kaam ko kar guzrey to uskey liye das nekiyan likh lo, aur jab wo kisi burey kaam ka irada karey to kuchh na likho , aur agar wo burey kaam ko kar daley to sirf eik gunah likho , phir agar wo usey chhod dey (kabhi Raavi ney ye kaha) aur kabhi ye kaha (dobara) us gunah ka irtikab na karey to uskey liye is par bhi eik neki likh lo , phir aap ney aayat :(من جاء بالحسنة فله عشر أمثالها) padhi. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. faeyda padhi. : ''jisney nek kaam kiya hoga us ko das guna sawab milega , aur jisney burai ki hogi us ko usi qadr saza mileygi aur un par zulm na kiya jaeyga'' (Anaam-190)."
"3074","Muslim bin Yasar Al-Juhani ne riwayat ki ke Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنه) se is aayat ke bare mein sawal kiya gaya: \Aur jab tumhare Rabb ne Aadam ki aulad se...\"""""
"3075","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab Allah Ta'ala ne Adam (علیہ السلام) ko paida kiya to uske pith par haath phira aur har aisi shakhs jo uski nasal mein Qayamat ke din tak paida hone wala tha"
"3076","Samurah bin Jundab (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb hzrt hwaa (alyha alslam) hamlh hwyyn۔"""
"3077","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab Allah Ta'ala ne Adam (علیہ السلام) ko paida kiya\"" (اور حدیث ذیل میں بیان فرمائی)"""
"3078","**Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu):**\n\nMus'ab bin Sa'd (rz all anh) nay apnay wald (sad bn aby wqas rz all anh) say rwayt ky kh aap nay frmaya:\n\n\ghzwh bdr kay dn myn nay ayk tlwar layy awr kha: aay allh kay rswl (sly allh alyh wslm)! bay shk allh taalyٰ nay myray synh kw mshrkyn say mtmyn kr dya hay — ya as jysy kwyy bat — tw yh tlwar mjhay day dyjyay۔ aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: yh myray lyay nhyn hay۔\"""""
"3079","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke: \Jab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Badr se khatam hue...\"""""
"3080","# hdys ka trjmh\n\n**hm say hnad nay rwayt ky، anhwn nay abw maawyh say rwayt ky، anhwn nay aamsh say rwayt ky، anhwn nh shqyq bn slamh say rwayt ky، anhwn nay abdh (allh an say razy hw) say rwayt ky، anhwn nay kha:**\n\nrswl allh (allh kh an ph awr brktyn hwn) nay frmaya:\n\n> **\js nay ksy mslman ka mal chhynnay kay lyay jhwty qsm khayy، wh allh say as hal myn mlay ga kh wh as say ghzb nak hwga\""**\n\nashas bn qys (allh an say razy hw) nay kha: \""allh ky qsm! yh bat myray baray myn thy۔ ayk yhwdy shkhs kay sath myra ayk zmyn kay baray myn jhgra tha۔ as nay myra dawyٰ mansay ankar kya، tw myn asay nby (allh kh an ph awr brktyn hwn) kay pas laya۔ rswl allh (allh kh an ph awr brktyn hwn) nay mjh say frmaya: **'kya tmharay pas kwy dlyl hay؟'** myn nay kha: 'nhyn۔' tw aap nay yhwdy say frmaya: **'tm qsm khao۔'** myn nay kha: 'aay rswl allh! agr wh qsm kha lay ga tw myra mal chhyn lay ga۔' phr allh taaly nay yh aayt nazl frmayy:\n\n> **\""bay shk jw lwg allh kay ahd awr apnay aqsam kw thwray maawzay myn bdl dytay hyn…'** (aal amran، :) — aayt kay aakhr tk\n\nabw aysy (trmzy) nay frmaya: **\""yh hsn shyh hdys hay۔\""** awr as mwzwa pr abn aby awfy (allh an say razy hw) say bhy rwayat hyn۔"""
"3081","# Scholarly Roman Urdu Translation\n\nHadees ka bayan hum se kiya Ishaq ibn Mansur ne, unhone hum se bayan kiya Abdullah ibn Bakr al-Sahmi ne, unhone hum se riwayat ki Humayd ne, unho ne Anas رضي الله عنه se naql kiya, unhone farmaya:\n\nJab yeh aayat nazil hui: **\Tum kabhi taqwa (nekī) hasil nahi kar sakte jab tak tum apne pasandeeda maal se kharch na karo\""** (Aal-e-Imraan 3:92) — ya yeh aayat: **\""Kaun hai jo Allah ko qarz-e-hasan de taake uske liye usay bohat zyada guna barha de?\""** (Al-Baqarah 2:245) — to Abu Talhah رضي الله عنه"
"3082","Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay mnbr pr yh aayt tlawt frmayy: «wadwa lmْ ma asttatmْ mnْ qwٍ» (swr anfal، aayt 60)۔ aap ﷺ nay frmaya: «bay shk taqt tyr andazy hay» — aap ﷺ nay yh jmlh tyn mrtbh frmaya — «bay shk allh tmharay lyay zmyn khwl day ga awr tmhyn sazwsaman say bay nyaz kr day ga»۔"
"3083","Hazrat 'Amr bin Murrah (rhh) rwayt krtay hyn kh abw abydh bn abdallh (rhh) nay hzrt abdallh bn msawd (rzy allh anh) say rwayt ky، wh frmatay thay: \ghzwh bdr kay dn"""
"3084","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Tum se pehle kisi bhi kaale sar wale (yaani Bani Adam"
"3085","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat hai ki: Maine 'Uthman bin 'Affan (razi Allahu anhu) se pucha: \Al-Anfal ke mutaaliq aap ka kya ghalat fahmi yeh hai ke yeh Muthani (woh surah jis mein so aayat se kam hain) mein se hai?\"""""
"3086","Sulaiman bin Amr bin Al-Ahwas ne riwayat ki:\n\nMere baap ne mujhe bayan farmaya ke woh Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath widaa’ Hajj mein haazir the. Aap (ﷺ) ne Allah Ta’ala ka shukar ada farmaya aur uski hamd-o-sana kahi."
"3087","Hazrat Ali (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke maine Rasool Allah (ﷺ) se Al-Hajj Al-Akbar ke din ke baare mein poocha."
"3088","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey puchha : Hajje-Akbar ka din kon sa hai? aap ney farmaya : ''nahar (qurbani) ka din hai.''"
"3089","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai:\n\n\Paighaambar-e-Akram (ﷺ) ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (رضي الله عنه) ko Bara'at (mushrikeen se bara'at ka elaan) lekar bheja. Phir unhe bulakar farmaya: 'Yeh baat kisi ke liye munasib nahi ke ise koi mera khaandaani (ahle bait) siwaaye kisi aur ke phesle kare.' Phir unhon ne Hazrat Ali (رضي الله"""
"3090","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh:\n\n\rswl allh (ﷺ) nay abwbkr (rzy allh anh) kw bhyja awr anhyn yh batyn aalan krnay ka hkm dya۔ phr aly (rzy allh anh) an kay pychhay pychhay gyay۔ abwbkr (rzy allh anh) jb ayk khas rastay pr thay، tw whan ky aawaz ky wh batyn sn rhay thay jw anhyn aalan krnay ka hkm dya gya tha۔\"""""
"3091","Zaid bin Yuthai' ne riwayat farmaya: Hum ne Ali (razi Allahu anh) se poocha ke unhein Hajj ke dauran kis cheez ke saath bheja gaya tha. Unhon ne farmaya: \Mujhe chaar baaton ke saath bheja gaya tha: Ye ke ghar (Ka'ba) ke gird nangey haal mein tawaf na kiya jaye.\"""""
"3092","Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum kisi aadmi ko masjid mein aata dekho\"""""
"3093","Thawban (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: \Aur jinhon ne sona aur chandi jama kar rakhi...\"" (Surah At-Tawbah"
"3094","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \nMain Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas aaya jab mere gale mein sona ka ek salib tha. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Aye 'Adi! Ye but apne gale se utaar de!\"" \nAur maine unhe Surah Bara'at ki aayat padhte hue suna: \n**\""Unhon ne apne aulama aur saadhon ko Allah ke siwa mabood bana liya\""** (9:31). \nAap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n**\""Unke liye to yahi tha...\""** \n\n*(Note: Hadith ka mukammal matlab yeh hai ke Hazrat 'Adi (رضي الله عنه) ne apne gale se soni ki salib utaar di"
"3095","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Ibn Abi Umar ne riwayat ki, Sufyan ne riwayat ki, unho ne Al-A'mash se, unho ne Abdullah ibn Murrah se, unho ne Masruq se, aur unho ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud (Razi Allah un se) se riwayat ki ke un se Allah Ta'ala ke is farmaan ke mutaalliq sawal kiya gaya:**\n\n*\Aur tum kabhi un logon ko"
"3096","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Razi Allah unho) ne farmaya: \Main ne Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (Razi Allah unho) ko suna keh rahe thay ke jab Abdullah bin Ubayy mar gaya"""
"3097","Ibn 'Umar (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay:\n\n\abdallh bn abdallh bn aby jb apnay wald ky wfat kay bad rswl allh ﷺ ky khdmt myn hazr hwyay۔\"""""
"3098","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke do aapas mein is Masjid ke mutafiq ho gaye jis ki bunyad pehle din Taqwa par rakhi gayi (9:108). Ek shakhs ne kaha: \Yeh Masjid Quba hai\"" aur doosre ne kaha: \""Yeh Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki Masjid hai.\"" To Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Yeh meri Masjid hai.\"""""
"3099","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi-e-Akram (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ayah (9:108) Quba ke logon ke mutalliq nazil hui: 'Is mein aise log hain jo apne aap ko saaf karna pasand karte hain"
"3100","Hazrat Ali (rzy allh anh) nay byan frmaya: \myn nay ayk shkhs kw apnay bt pwjnay walay waldyn kay lyay astghfar krtay sna۔\"""""
"3101","**Urdu Translation (Roman Script):**\n\nHazrat Abdur-Rahman bin Ka'b bin Malik (رضي الله عنہ) نے اپنے باپ سے روایت کی ہے کہ انہوں نے فرمایا: \میں کسی بھی ایسی جنگ سے پیچھے نہیں رہا جس میں نبی کریم ﷺ نے شرکت کی۔\""\n\n---\n\n**Islamic Honorifics Used:**\n- ﷺ — *Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam* (Peace and Blessings of Allah be upon him)\n- رضي الله"""
"3102","**Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\nHazrat Muhammad ibn 'Abd al-A'la al-San'ani ne riwayat ki, unho ne Khalid ibn al-Harith se, unho ne Shu'bah se, unho ne 'Ubaydullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Anas se, unho ne Hazrat Anas (Razi Allah un se) se, aur unho ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat ki ke **Kabair (Bade Gunahon)** ke mutalliq, Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n**\Shirk Allah ke saath"
"3103","Hazrat Zuhri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ne Hazrat Anas (Radi Allahu Anhu) se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya: \n\Hazrat Huzaifah bin Yaman (Radi Allahu Anhu) Hazrat Uthman (Radi Allahu Anhu) ke paas aaye.\"""""
"3104","Abdullah ibn Unays al-Juhani (Razi Allah un se) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Beshak kabira gunaon mein se azeem tareen gunah hain: Allah ke saath shareek banana"
"3105","Ata bin Yasar ne riwayat ki: Misr ke ek shakhs se, jisne kaha: \Maine Abu Ad-Darda (رضي الله عنہ) se is aayat ke baare mein poocha: 'Unke liye duniya ki zindagi mein bhi khushkhabri hai' (10:64). Unhon ne kaha: 'Mere baad se kisi ne mujhse iske baare mein nahi poocha"
"3106","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab Allah Ta'ala ne Fir'awn ko doobaya to usne kaha: 'Main is Parwadar par iman laya jis par Bani Isra'il iman laye hain.' Toh Jibrael (علیہ"""
"3107","Hadees ke mutabiq, Shu'bah ne riwayat farmayi:\n\n\Meri baat suno"
"3108","Waki' bin Hudus ne apne ammi Abu Razin se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Maine kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Aapke Rab ne apna khalqat paida karne se pehle woh kahan tha?\"" Farmaya: \""Woh badalon ke upar tha — neeche koi hawa (ya hawa) nahi tha.\"""""
"3109","Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala buland-o-ba Izzat zulm karne wale ko mohlat deta hai (Yumli)\"" aur shayad unhone farmaya: \""(Yumhil)\"" mohlat deta hai jab tak..."""
"3110","Hazrat Ibn 'Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh hzrt amr khtab (rzy allh anh) nay frmaya: \jb yh aayt nazl hwyy: 'an myn say kchh bdbkht hyn awr kchh khwsh qsmt (11:105)' tw myn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say arz kya: 'aay allh kay nby! hm pr ks bnyad pr aml kr rhay hyn؛ kwyy aysy chyz jw phlay hy mkml hw chky hay ya kwyy aysy chyz jw abhy pysh nhyn aayy؟' aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: 'blkh yh aysy chyz hay jw phlay hy tay chky hay۔'\"""""
"3111","Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Ek shakhs Nabi (ﷺ) ke paas aaya aur bola: 'Maine Madinah ki sarhad par rehne wali ek aurat ko chhua..."""
"3112","Hazrat Mu'adh bin Jabal (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke:\n\nEk shakhs Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas aayi aur arz ki: \Ya Rasoolullah! Aap kya farmate hain us shaksh ke baare mein jo ek aurat se milta hai aur unke darmiyaan koi shanakht nahi hai. Phir woh kuch nahi karta jo mard apni biwi ke saath karta hai"
"3113","Ibn Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne ek aurat ko ghair kanooni taur par chuma. Woh Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas uski kaffaaray ke baare mein poochne aaye. Toh yeh aayat nazil hui: \Aur namaz padho...\"""""
"3114","Hazrat Musa bin Talhah ne riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abu Al-Yasar (raziya Allahu anhu) ne farmaya:\n\n\Aurat mere paas khajoor bechne aayi. Maine us se kaha: 'Ghar mein is se behtar khajoor hain.' Toh woh mere saath ghar andar aayi. Mujhe us par khwahish paida ho gayi aur maine usse chumne laga. Phir maine Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziya Allahu anhu) ke paas jaa kar yeh baat unhen bata di.\"""""
"3115","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak...\"""""
"3116","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke: \nYahoodiyon ne Nabi ﷺ ke paas aya aur kaha: “Ya Abul-Qasim! Humein garaj (thunder) ke baare mein bataiye.”"
"3117","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne aayat: \Baaz ko hum baaz par falha ke liye tarjeeh dete hain (13:4)\"" par farmaya: \""Daqal...\"""""
"3118","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) ky khdmt myn ayk brtn laya gya js myn kham khrma tha۔ aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: nyk klmay ky msal nyk drkht ky sy hay۔"
"3119","Al-Bara (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke muta'aliq: \Allah un logon ko jo iman laaye"
"3120","Masruq (rhmh allh) nay rwayt ky kh hzrt aayshh sdyqh rzy allh anha nay yh aayt tlawt ky: \n**\ywm tbdl alarz ghyr alarz\""** (swrh abrahym، aayt )۔ \nanhwn nay arz ky: \""ya rswl allh! lwg khan hwn gay؟\"" \naap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: **\""srat pr\""** (yany dwzkh kay awpr rkhy hwyy ptly sy syrhy pr)۔"""
"3121","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai:\n\n\Ek aurat Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke peeche namaz padhti thi jo logon se sab se khoobsurat thi. Kuch log aage ki saf mein chale jaate taake unhe na dekhein. Aur kuch log peeche ki saf mein chale jaate taake jab woh ruku karein to unhe na dekhein.\"""""
"3122","Ibn Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh nby krym ﷺ nay frmaya: \jhnm kay sat drwazay hyn؛ an myn say ayk drwazh as shkhs kay lyay hay jw myry amt khlaf tlwar athayay۔\"" ya aap ﷺ nay yh frmaya: \""mhmd ﷺ ky amt khlaf tlwar athayay۔\"""""
"3123","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Al-Hamdulillah Umm-ul-Qur'an aur Umm-ul-Kitab hai aur yeh saat martaba dohraaye jaane waali aayat hai.\"""""
"3124","Ubayy bin Ka'b (رضي الله عنهم) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne Tawrat mein Umm Al-Kitab (Surah Al-Fatiha) jaisi koi cheez nahi nazil ki.\"""""
"3125","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke mutalliq: \Hum un sab ko zaroor unke aamal ke sabab se hisab lenge\"" (15:92-93)"
"3126","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Momin ki firasat se bacho.\"""""
"3127","Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki maine Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ko yeh kehte hue suna ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Zuhr se pehle (chaar raka'at) namaz padho.\"""""
"3128","Abd ibn Humaid ne humein riwayat ki, Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, Hammad ibn Salamah ne Ammar ibn Abi Ammar se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Ibn Abbas ne tilawat ki: *\Aaj main ne tumhare liye tumhare deen ko mukammal kar diya"
"3129","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi-e-Akram (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab mujhe Shab-e-Isra ki shab par le jaya gaya to maine Moosa (علیہ السلام) se mulaqat ki.\"" Unhon ne unka zikr karte hue farmaya: \""Woh ek aadmi the\"" aur mujhe lagta hai ke unhon ne farmaya: \""Patla sa aadmi the.\"""""
"3130","Hadees ke mutabiq Hazrat Anas (raziyaAllahu anho) ne bayan farmaya ke Shaab-e-ISRA mein Nabi Kareem (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) par Al-Buraq laya gaya."
"3131","Ibn Buraidah (raziyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain ke unke abu (raziyallahu anhu) se ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab hum Bait Al-Maqdis pahunchay\"""""
"3132","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb qrysh nay mjhay jhtlaya...\"""""
"3133","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne riwayat ki, jo Muhammad ibn Yusuf se naqal kiya, jo Isra'il se riwayat kiya, jo Abu Ishaq se hadith bayan ki, jo Umar ibn Sharahil Abu Mayssarah se naqal kiya, jo Umar ibn al-Khattab (Razi Allahu Anhu) se riwayat farmate hain, unhone farmaya:**\n\n**\A'e Allah! Humain sharab ke muta'alliq wazeh aur shifa bayaan karne wala bayan ata farma.\""** Phir Surah al-Baqarah ki aayat nazil hui: *\""Tujh se sharab aur qimar ke baare mein poochhte hain...\""* (2:219). Umar (Razi Allahu Anhu) ko bulaya gaya aur aayat unhen padh kar sunayi gayi. Unhone phir farmaya: **\""A'e Allah! Humain sharab ke muta'alliq wazeh aur shifa bayaan karne wala bayan ata farma.\""** Phir Surah al-Nisa' ki aayat nazil hui: *\""A'e iman walon! Nashe ki haalat mein namaz ke paas na jaao...\""* (4:43). Umar (Razi Allahu Anhu) ko bulaya gaya aur aayat unhen padh kar sunayi gayi. Unhone phir farmaya: **\""A'e Allah! Humain sharab ke muta'alliq wazeh aur shifa bayaan karne wala bayan ata farma.\""** Phir Surah al-Ma'idah ki aayat nazil hui: *\""Beshak shaitan chahta hai ke sharab aur qimar ke zariye tum mein adawat aur bughz paida kare...\""* (5:91) yahan tak ke Uzri Kalam: *\""Kya tum phir bhi baaz aoge?\""* (5:91). Umar (Razi Allahu Anhu) ko bulaya gaya aur aayat unhen padh kar sunayi gayi. Unhone farmaya: **\""Hum baaz aa chuke"
"3134","Al-Bara' (unho se Allah raazi ho) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wasallam) ke ashaab mein se kuch aisa log mar gaye jo sharab ke hote hue waf kar gaye"
"3135","# Ḥadīth kā Tarjumah\n\nHādhā ḥadīth Shuʿbah, Abū Isḥāq, aur al-Barāʾ (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhum) se marwī hai. Muḥammad ibn Bashshār Bundār ne hamen is khabar kī ḳhabar dī, unhone kaha: Muḥammad ibn Jaʿfar ne hamen kaha, unhone kaha: Shuʿbah ne hamen riwāyat kī, Abū Isḥāq se, is silsilah (isnād) ke sāth. Unhone kaha: al-Barāʾ ibn ʿāzib (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) ne farmāyā:\n\n\Ṣaḥābah-e-Karām (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhum ajmaʿīn) mein se kuch aise ṣaḥābī (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhum) wafāt pā jab ke woh khamr (sharāb-e-muskir) pī rahe the. Jab is ke ḥarām hone kā ḥukm nāzil huā"
"3136","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Allah Ta'ala ke is farman se mutalliq: \n\Shaayad tera Rubb tere liye us muqamm-e-mahmood tak tujhe bulaye\"" (17:79) — \nRasoolullah (ﷺ) se is bare mein sawaal kiya gaya"
"3137","Ibn Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai: \n\Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne Fath-e-Makkah ke saal Makkah mein dakhil kiya.\"""""
"3138","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**ʿAmr ibn ʿAlī Abū Ḥafṣ al-Fallās ne riwāyat karte hue farmāyā, unhone Abū ʿĀṣim se sunā, unhone ʿUthmān ibn Saʿd se sunā, unhone ʿIkrimah se sunā, aur ʿIkrimah ne Ibn ʿAbbās (Razi Allahu ʿAnhu) se sunā:**\n\nEk ādmī Nabī ﷺ ke pās āyā aur usne arz kī: \Yā Rasūlallāh! Jab bhī maiṅ gosht khātā hūṅ"
"3139","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Razi Allah Unho) ne riwayat farmaya: \Quraish ne Yahood se kaha: 'Hamen kuch aisa dena jiske bare mein hum is shakhs se pooch sakein.' To unhone kaha: 'Uss se Ruh (rooh) ke baare mein poochho.' Phir unhone uss se Ruh ke baare mein sawaal kiya. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne...\"""""
"3140","Hazrat Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Main ek baat mein Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath Madinah ("""
"3141","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din logon ko teen girohon mein jama kiya jayega: ek giroh paidal chalta hua"
"3142","Sa'eed ibn Ya'qub al-Talaqani ne hum se rivayat kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hume khabar di, Utbah ibn Abi Hakim ne hum se rivayat kiya, Amr ibn Jariyah al-Lakhmi ne Abu Umayyah al-Sha'bani se, ke unhonne kaha: ""Main Abu Tha'labah al-Khushani ke paas aaya aur unse kaha: 'Aap is ayat mein kaise amal karte hain?' Unhone pucha: 'Kaun si ayat?' Maine kaha: 'Uski ayat: Ya ayyuha allazeena aamanu alaykum anfusakum la yadurrukum man dalla iza ihtadaytum.' Unhone kaha: 'Qasam Allah ki, tumne iske baare mein khabar (aalim) se poocha. Maine Rasoolullah ﷺ se iske baare mein poocha to unhonne farmaya: ""Bal (balki) tum ma'ruf ka hukm do aur munkar se roko, jab tak tum bukhl (kanjoosi) ko maana jate dekho, aur hawa (khwahishat) ko peechha karte dekho, aur duniya ko tarjeeh dete dekho, aur har rai wale ko apni rai par magroor dekho, to apni nafs ki khaasiyat (apna khayal rakho) par qaim raho aur awam ko chhor do. Kyunke tumhare peeche aise din aayenge jisme sabr karna aag pakarne jaisa hoga, aur un dinon mein kaam karne wale ka sawab 50 aadmiyon ke barabar hoga jo tumhari tarah kaam karein."" Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne kaha: Ghair Utbah ne mujhe ziada bataya, poocha gaya: ""Ya Rasoolullah, 50 aadmiyon ka sawab hum mein se ya un mein se?"" Unhone farmaya: ""Nahi, balki 50 tum mein se."" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith hasan gharib hai."
"3143","Safwan bin Assal Al-Muradi (رضي الله عنه) rivayat karte hain ke ek Yahuda apne saathi ne kaha: 'Is Nabiy (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke paas humein chalo.' Us saathi ne kaha: 'Nabi (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke naam se na bolo.'"
"3144","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Sufyān ibn Wakīʿ** ne hamari taraf se riwāyat ki: **Yaḥyā ibn Ādam** ne riwāyat ki, **Ibn Abī Zāʾidah** se, **Muḥammad ibn Abī al-Qāsim** se, **ʿAbd al-Malik ibn Saʿīd** se, uske wālid se, **Ibn ʿAbbās** رضي الله عنهما se, unhone farmāyā:\n\nBanī Sahm se ek ādmī Tamīm al-Dārī aur ʿAdī ibn Buzāʾ ke sāth safar par niklā. Sahmī ādmī ek aise mulk mein mar gaya jahān koī Musalmān maujūd nahīṅ thā. Jab woh dono sāthī uske māl lekar wāpas āe, to unheṅ (wārithoṅ ko) ek chāṅdī kā sone se muraṣṣaʿ bartan gāʾib milā. Pas Rasūlullāh ﷺ ne un par qasam dilāʔī. Iske baʿd woh bartan Makkah mein milā aur kahā gayā: \Hamne ʿAdī aur Tamīm se khareedā hai.\"" Phir Banī Sahm ke wārisoṅ meṅ se do ādmī khaṛe hue aur Allāh kī qasam khākar kahā: \""Hamārī gawāhī un kī gawāhī se zyāda mustaḥaqq hai aur yeh bartan yaqīnan unke sāthī (marḥūm) kā hai.\""\n\nIbn ʿAbbās رضي الله"""
"3145","Sa'eed bin Jubair ne rivaayat kiya, Ibn Abbas (radiallahu anhu) se, Allah Ta'ala ke irshad ke mutaalliq: \Aur apni Salaat na zor ki awaaz mein padho aur na chupke se"
"3146","Zirr bin Hubaish ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Hudhaifah bin Al-Yaman se kya: 'Kya Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Bait Al-Maqdis mein Salaat ada ki?' Unhon ne kya: 'Nahi.' Main ne kya: 'Lekin unhon ne ada ki.' Unhon ne kya: 'Tum yeh kehte ho.'\"""""
"3147","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Main Qayamat ke din Aadam (علیہ السلام) ke sab farzandon ka sardar hoon"
"3148","Sa'eed bin Jubair ne riwayat ki: \Maine Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se kaha: 'Nawf Al-Bikali ka daawa hai ke Musa (علیہ السلام) —'\"""""
"3149","Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh aby bn kab (rz all anh) nay byan kya kh nby krym ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw lrka khzr (alyh alslam) nay mara، wh as dn say kafr mqdr tha jb asay pyda kya gya tha۔\"""""
"3150","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Use 'Al-Khadir' is liye kaha gaya kyunke woh ek sookhi Farwah (resham ya kapde ka tukda) par baitha aur uske neeche wah sabz ho gaya.\"""""
"3151","Abu Darda (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh allh taalyٰ kay frman: \awr an kay nychay ayk khzanh tha jw an ka tha\"" (swrh alkhf، aayt 82) kay baray myn nby akrm (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""swna awr chandy۔\"""""
"3152","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Ahmad ibn Mani' (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ne riwayat ki:**\n\nIshaq ibn Yusuf al-Azraq ne humein bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abi Hind ne humein riwayat kiya, unho ne Sha'bi se riwayat ki, aur unho ne Masrūq se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya:\n\n\Main Aisha (Radi Allahu Anha) ki sohbat mein takiye par takiye laga kar baitha tha"
"3153","Muḥammad ibn Mūsā al-Baṣrī al-Ḥarashī ne ham se riwāyat bayaan kī, Ziyād ibn ʿAbdullāh al-Bakkāʾī ne ham se riwāyat kī, ʿAṭāʾ ibn al-Sāʾib ne Saʿīd ibn Jubayr se riwāyat kī, aur Saʿīd ibn Jubayr ne ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿAbbās (raz̤ī allāhu ʿanhumā) se riwāyat kī, unhone farmāya:\n\n\Chand log Nabī ﷺ ke pās āe aur kahā"
"3154","Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: rswl allh ﷺ nay mjhay njran bhyja۔ an lwgwn nay mj say kha: \kya tm lwg yh nhyn prhtay: aay harwn ky bhn! (19:28) halankh mwsyٰ a awr aysyٰ a kay drmyan atny mdt ka faslh hay jtna hay؟\"" mjhay malwm nhyn tha kh an ka jwab kysay dwn۔ ps jb myn nby krym ﷺ kay pas waps aaya،"""
"3155","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ ne padha: Aur unhein gham aur pachhtaawa ke din se daraao (19:39) aur farmaya: Maut ko is tarah laaya jayega goyaa ek mila-julaa kaalaa aur safed bakraa hai."
"3156","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Abd ibn Humaid ne hamain bayan farmaya:** Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hamain riwayat ki, Fudayl ibn Ghazwan se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu Anhu) se, Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Irshad farmaya:\n\n**\Teen cheezein jab zahir ho jayengi"
"3157","Sa'eed bin Jubair ne Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Jibra'il (عليه السلام) se farmaya: \Tumhein humare zyada baar aane se kya cheez rokti hai?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Phir yeh aayat nazil hui: Aur hum sirf tumhare Rubb ke hukm se utarte hain. Usi ke liye hai jo kuch hamare aagey hai aur jo kuch hamare peechay hai.\"" Aayat ke aakhri tak (19:)."""
"3158","As-Suddi ne riwayat kiya: \Main ne Murrah Al-Hamdani se Allah Ta'ala ke farmaan ke baare mein poochha.\"""""
"3159","Hazrat Shu'bah riwayat farmate hain ke Hazrat As-Suffi ne Hazrat Murrah se riwayat ki, aur Hazrat Murrah ne Hazrat Abdullah (radi Allahu anhu) se naql ki ke unhone farmaya:\n\n\Tum mein se koi aisa nahi jo is (Jahannum ki aag) par guzar kar guzre (19:71) - woh sab is par guzar kar guzrengay.\"""""
"3160","Abu Horaira (rzy allh anh) khtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jb allh ksy bnday say mhbt krta hay tw jbrayyl (alyh alslam) kw blata hay۔\"""""
"3161","Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nMasruq (rhmh allh) nay byan kya: myn nay khbab bn art (rzy allh anh) kw khtay sna: myn bnw shm kay shkhs aas bn wayl kay pas as ka qrz wswl krnay kay lyay aaya۔ as nay kha: tmhyn kchh nhyn mlay ga jb tk tm mhmd (sly allh alyh wslm) ka ankar nhyn kr dytay۔ myn nay kha: nhyn۔"
"3162","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Khaibar se wapas aa rahe thay, raat ki safar karke thak gay aur aaram ke liye baith gay. Phir farmaya: \Aye Bilal! Humare liye raat ki hifaazat karo.\"" Kaha ke Bilal (رضي الله عنه) ne namaz padhi."""
"3163","Abu Sa'eed (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jhnm ky wady ky khraby hw۔\"""""
"3164","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi aaya aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saamne baitha aur usne arz ki: \Ya Rasoolallah! Mere do ghulam hain jo mujhe jhoot bolte hain...\"""""
"3165","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \abrahym (alyh alslam)...\"""""
"3166","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke: \nRasoolullah (ﷺ) ne khutba (sermon) dene ke liye khade hue."
"3167","Imran bin Husain (رضي الله عنهما) ne bayan farmaya: jab yeh aayat nazil hui: \Aey logon! Apne Rubb se daro! Yaqeenan qayamat ka zalzala bahut sakht cheez hai...\"" us ke farmabaad tak: \""Lekin Allah ka azaab bahut sakht hai...\"" (22:1 & 2) — unhone kaha: \""Yeh aayat is waqt nazil hui jab woh (ﷺ) safar mein the aur unhon ne farmaya: 'Kya tum jaante ho yeh din kaun sa hai?' To unhone kaha: 'Allah aur uske Rasool (ﷺ) behtar jaante hain.' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Yeh woh din hai jab Allah Adam (عليه"""
"3168","Hadees ka tarjuma Imran bin Husain (رضي الله عنہ) se marwi hai: Hum Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke saath safar mein thay, kuch sahaba (رضي الله عنہم) peechay reh gaye. Aap (ﷺ) ne apni aawaz buland karke do aayatein padhin: \Aey logon! Apne Rubb ka khauf rakho! Yaqeenan qayamat ka zalzala bahut sakht hai...\"" taan farmaya: \""magar Allah ki saza bahut sakht hai.\"" (21:1 aur 2) Jab sahaba (رضي الله عنہم) ne yeh suna"""
"3169","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zubair (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \as kw albyt alatyq srf as lyay kha jata hay kh ksy zalm nay as pr fth nhyn ky۔\"""""
"3170","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat farmayi: \Jab Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ko Makkah Mukarrama se nikala gaya...\"""""
"3171","Sa'eed bin Jubair (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: jb nby krym ﷺ kw mkh say nkala gya tw ayk shkhs nay kha: \an lwgwn nay apnay nby kw nkal dya\"" tw yh aayt nazl hwyy: \""an lwgwn kw jng ky ajazt dy gyyay hyn jn pr jng kya gya hay۔\"""""
"3172","Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat farmaya: \Jab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasalam) par wahi naazil hoti thi...\"""""
"3173","Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh alrbya bnt nzr (rz all anha) nby krym (ﷺ) kay pas aayyn — awr an kay bytay harsh bn sraqh (rz all anh) jng bdr kay dn shhyd hw chkay thay۔"
"3174","Hazrat 'Abdur-Rahman bin [Sa'eed bin] Wahb - yani Al-Hamdani - rivayat karte hain ke Hazrat 'Aishah (radiyallahu 'anha), Nabi (ﷺ) ki maqsood ziyarat se in ke baare mein poochtay hain ke Hazrat 'Aishah (radiyallahu 'anha) ne farmaya: \Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se is aayat ke baare mein sawal kiya: Aur woh log jo apni ne'maton ko dete hain aur unke dil khauf se bhare hote hain... (23:60)\"" Hazrat 'Aishah (radiyallahu 'anha) ne kaha: \""Kya woh woh log hain jo sharab peete hain aur chor karte hain?\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Nahi"
"3175","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat karte hain ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Wahan woh muskurayenge.\"""""
"3176","# Ḥadīth kā Tarjumah\n\n**Ibn Abī 'Umar ne riwāyat kiyā, jis ne Sufyān se riwāyat kiyā, jis ne Abū Isḥāq se riwāyat kiyā, jis ne Zaid bin Yuthay' se riwāyat kiyā, unhone kahā:**\n\n\Neḥ (raḍiyAllāhu 'anhū) se hamne pūchhā: 'Āp (ṣallAllāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) [Vidā'] Ḥajj ke bāzū mein kis cheez ke sāth bheje gaye thā?' Unhon ne jawāb diyā: 'Mujh cheezon ke sāth bhejā gayā thā: Yā kisi ne Baytullāh (ta'ālā) kā ṭawāf nange haālat mein na kare; aur jo kisī ke Nabī (ṣallAllāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) ke sāth 'ahad hai"
"3177","Sa'eed bin Jubair (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki:\n\n\Mujhse un logon ke baare mein poochha gaya jo Li'aan (li'aan karne wale) mein shamil the"
"3178","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: \Hilal bin Umayyah (rz all anh) nby krym (ﷺ) ky khdmt myn hazr hwyay awr apny bywy pr Sharik bin Sahma (rz all anh) kay sath zna ka alzam lgaya۔ rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: 'ya tw tm gwah pysh krw۔'\"""""
"3179","# Ḥadīth kā Tarjumah\n\nḤuṣain ibn Yazīd al-Kūfī ne ḥum ko ḥadīth sunāʾī, ʿAbd al-Salām ibn Ḥarb ne ḥum ko ḥadīth sunāʾī, Ghuṭayf ibn Aʿyan se riwāyat kī, Muṣʿab ibn Saʿd se naql kā, ʿAdī ibn Ḥātim se riwāyat kā, jo farmāyā:\n\n\Main Nabī ﷺ ke pās āyā jab ke mere gardan par ek sonē kā ṣalīb thā. Unhon ne farmāyā: **'Ai ʿAdī"
"3180","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Ziyād ibn Ayyūb al-Baghdādī ne riwāyat kī, jis ne ʿAffān ibn Muslim se riwāyat kī, jis ne Hammām se riwāyat kī, jis ne Thābit se riwāyat kī, Anas رضي الله عنه se, ki Abū Bakr رضي الله عنه ne unhein bayān kiyā, farmaate hue:**\n\n\Main ne Nabī ﷺ se kahā jab hum ghār mein the: 'Agar un mein se koi apne qadam ke neeche dekhe"
"3181","Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne kaha: \Maine kaha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool (ﷺ)! Sab se bada gunah kya hai?' Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: 'Yeh ke tum Allah ke liye koi shareek qarar do.'\"""""
"3182","Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se poocha ke sab se bara gunah kya hai? Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: 'Yeh ke tum Allah ke liye koi shareek thehrao"
"3183","Hazrat Aisha (R.A.) ne riwayat farmaya ke: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: \Aur apne qareebi rishtedaaron ko khabaradaar kar do\"" (Surah Ash-Shu'ara"
"3184","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krthyn kh: jw aayt \apnh qrabty khandan kw mtnbh krw\"" (26:214) nazl hwyy، phr rswl allh (ﷺ) nhr qrysh kh khandanw kw ayk ayk kar kr kh sb kh jma kya۔"""
"3185","Qasamah bin Zuhair ne riwayat ki: \n\Ash'ari ne kaha: 'Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: \""Aur apne qareebi rishtedaaron ko khabar daar kar do\"" (26:214)"
"3186","Abu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Zameen se ek janwar niklega. Us ke paas Sulaiman (alaihis salaam) ka aurhtaa hoga aur Moosa (alaihis salaam) ka asa (laathi) hoga. Woh momin ki chehra roshan karega.\"""""
"3187","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki** — **Abd ar-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki** — **Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne riwayat ki**, **az-Zuhri** se, **Ubayd ibn as-Sabbak** se, aur **Zayd ibn Thabit** — رضي الله عنه — ne unhen riwayat kiya, farmaaya:\n\nAbu Bakr as-Siddiq — رضي الله عنه — ne Yamamah ke logon ke qatl-e-aam ke waqt mujhe bulaya, aur dekhiye, Umar ibn al-Khattab — رضي الله عنه — uske saath the. Abu Bakr ne farmaaya: \Beshak"
"3188","# Tarjumah-e-Hadith (Scholarly Roman Urdu Translation)\n\n**Muḥammad ibn Bashshār ne hamain bataya, ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn Mahdī ne hamain bataya, Ibrāhīm ibn Saʿd ne al-Zuhrī se riwāyat kī, al-Zuhrī ne Anas (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) se riwāyat kī ke Ḥudhayfah (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) ʿUthmān ibn ʿAffān (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) ke pās āe — Ḥudhayfah aur ʿUthmān dono par Raḥmatullāhi Taʿālā — jabke woh Shaam ke logon ke saath Armenia aur Adharbījān ke fatḥ mein jihād mein mashgūl the, ʿIrāq ke logon ke saath. Ḥudhayfah ne Qurʾān ke mutaʿalliq un ke ikhtilāf dekhe, to unhone ʿUthmān ibn ʿAffān se farmāyā: \Ayyuhā Amīr al-Muʾminīn! Is Ummat ko pakar lo"
"3189","Umm Hani (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke mutaalliq: \...Aur tum apni mehfilon mein shararat karte ho...\"" (Surah Ankaboot"
"3190","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Surah Ar-Room ke aayat \Alif Lam Mim. Room maghlub kar diye gaye\"" ke mutaliq — yeh aarzoo ke qareebe mulk mein —"""
"3191","Abd ibn Humayd ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, al-Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne riwayat ki, Hammad ibn Salamah ne riwayat ki, Ali ibn Zayd se, Yusuf ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas (radhiAllahu anhu) se, aur unhon ne Nabi Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki:\n\n\Jab Allah Ta'ala ne Fir'awn ko doobaya"
"3192","**Urdu Translation (Roman Script):**\n\nMuhammad ibn Abd al-Aʿlā al-Ṣanʿānī ne riwāyat karte hue farmāyā ke Khālid ibn al-Ḥārith ne riwāyat karte hue farmāyā ke Shuʿbah ne mujhe ittılāʿ dī ke ʿAdīy ibn Thābit aur ʿAṭāʾ ibn al-Sāʾib ne Saʿīd ibn Jubayr se, aur Saʿīd ibn Jubayr ne Ibn ʿAbbās (رضی اللہ عنہما) se riwāyat kī — un mein se ek ne zikr kiya ke Nabī ﷺ ne farmāyā:\n\n\Beshak Jibrīl (علیہ السلام) Firʿawn ke muṅh mein māṭī ḍālate rahe"
"3193","**Hazrat Niyar bin Mukram Al-Aslami (Razi Allah Anhu) se marwi hai ke:**\n\n\Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: **'Alif Lam Mim. Roomiyon ka shikast khayi gayi hai. Qareeb tareen sarzameen mein...'** (Surah Ar-Room)\"""""
"3194","Abu Umamah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \glwkar awrtwn kw nh bychw۔\"""""
"3195","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne is aayat ke baare mein farmaya:\n\n**\Their sides forsake their beds\""** (32:16) — yeh aayat us namaz ke baare mein nazil hui hai jise tum **Al-'Atamah** kehte ho."""
"3196","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: 'Maine apne neik bandon ke liye woh tayyar kar rakha hai jise koi aankh ne nahi dekha...\"""""
"3197","Abd ibn Humaid ne humein riwayat ki, Husayn al-Ju'fi se, Zāʾidah se, ʿAbd al-Malik ibn ʿUmayr se, ʿAbd ar-Raḥmān ibn Abī Laylā se, aur Muʿādh ibn Jabal (رضي الله عنه) se, unhone farmaya:\n\nEk shakhs Nabi Kareem (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke paas aaya aur arz ki: \Ya Rasoolullah! Aap kya farmate hain us shaksh ke baare mein jo ek aurat se mila jis se uski koi pehle se waaqifiyat nahi thi"
"3198","# Ibn Mas'ūd (raḍiyallāhu 'anhu) ki Riāyat ke Mutābiq Gair-e-Mubāḥ Baus ke Kaffāre ke Bāb mein\n\n**Sanad (Narration Chain):**\nMuhammad ibn Bashshār ne ham ko riāyat kī — Yaḥyā ibn Sa'īd ne ham ko riāyat kī — Sulaymān al-Taymī se — Abū 'Uthmān se — Ibn Mas'ūd (raḍiyallāhu 'anhu) se:\n\n## Matn:\n\nEk mard ne ek aurat se gair-e-mubāḥ baus kiyā. Phir Nabī ﷺ ke āp ke pās āyā aur is kaffāre ke bāre mein daryāft kiyā. Tab āyat nazil hū'ī:\n\n> *\Din ke dono aakhāt (waqt) namāz qā'im karo aur raat ke kareeb waqt bhi. Yaqīnan nekīyāt burāiyyāt ko mīṭh detī hain. Ye ek naseehat hai un ke liye jo naseehāt qabool karte hain.\""*\n> — [Sūrah Hūd 11:114]\n\nĀdmī ne pūchhā: **\""Kāsh faqir ke liye hai"
"3199","Hazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: myray chcha zad bhayy hzrt ans bn nzr (rz all anh) jn kay nam pr mjhay ans ka nam dya gya، ghzwh bdr myn rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kay sath shryk nhyn hw skay۔ as bat nay anhyn bht rnj w mlal myn dala awr anhwn nay kha: \myn phly jng say ghyr hazr rha jw rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay shryk frmayy۔ allh ky qsm! agr allh taalyٰ mjhay rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kay sath ksy awr jng myn shrkt ka mwqa ata frmayay"""
"3200","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat farmayi ke mere chacha Jang-e-Badr mein shamil nahi hue the."
"3201","unkey chacha ( Anas bin Nazar ( Badr ki ladaai mein ghair hazir they, unhoney ( afsos kartey huye ( kaha : is pehli ladaai mein jo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mushrekin sey ladaai mein ghair mojud raha , ab agar Allah ney mushrekin sey mujhey kisi jang mein ladney ka moqey diya to Allah zarur dekhega ke main (be jigri o bahaaduri sey kis tarah ladta aur) kya karta hun . phir jab jange-Uhad ki ladaai ka moqey aaya , aur musalman ( maidan sey) chhat gaey to unhoney kaha : aey Allah main teri panah chahta hun us shar sey jisey ye log yani mushrekin ley kar aaye hain aur un sey yani aap key Sahaba sey jo ghalati sarzad hui hai, uskey liye tujh sey mazrat chahta hun, phir wo aagey badhey, un sey Saad bin Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ki mulaqat hui, Saad ney un sey kaha : merey bhai ! aap jo bhi karen mein aap key sath sath hun, ( Saad kehtey hain ( lekin unhoney jo kuch kya wo mein na kar saka , un ki laash par talwaar ki maar key , neze ghonpney key aur teer lagney key assi ( ۸۰ ( sey kuch ziyada hi zakham they, hum kehtey they ke unkey aur unkey sathiyon key barey mein aayat (فمنهم من قضى نحبه ومنهم من ينتظر) utri hai. Yazeed ( Raavi ( kehtey hain : is sey murad ye ( puri ( aayat hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Anas bin Malik key chacha ka naam Anas bin Nazar Raziallahu anhuma hai."
"3202","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Abū Hurayrah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay:**\n\nMaḥmūd ibn Khidāsh al-Baghdādy nay hm say byan kya، kha: Saif ibn Muḥammad al-Thawrī nay hm say rwayt ky، anhwn nay al-Aʿmash say، anhwn nay Abū Ṣāliḥ say، anhwn nay Abū Hurayrah (rzy allh anh) say، nby akrm ﷺ say allh taalyٰ kay frman kay baray myn:\n\n> **\awr hm nay an myn say baz kw baz pr lzt myn fzylt dy hay\""** (swrh alrad، :)\n\nnby akrm ﷺ nay frmaya: **\""adnyٰ khjwr (aldql)، farsy [khjwr]، mythy awr khty\""**\n\n(msnf) nay kha: **\""yh ayk hsn ghryb hdys hay۔ asay Zayd ibn Abī Unaysah nay bhy al-Aʿmash say asy trh rwayt kya hay۔ Saif ibn Muḥammad ʿAmmār ibn Muḥammad kay bhayy hyn، awr ʿAmmar an say zyadh sabt (mwsq) hyn۔ wh Sufyān al-Thawry ky khal kay bytay hyn\""**\n\n---\n\n*twzyh: yh hdys aayt krymh ky tshryh krty hay js myn phlwn kay zayqwn myn frq ka zkr hay۔ yh wazh hwta hay kh aysy hy qsm kay phlwn myn bhy ayk drjh bndy hay — adnyٰ qsm ky khjwr (dql) say lay kr aalyٰ tryn aqsam tk، awr mythay say lay kr khtay tk — yh sb allh taalyٰ kay hkm awr hkmt say hay، jw sb say blnd awr brtr hay۔*"""
"3203","Hazrat Aisha (radiyAllahu anha) ne riwayat kiya: \Jab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko hukm gaya ki apni biwiyon ko kheir (ikhtiyar) dein...\"""""
"3204","Hazrat Umar bin Abi Salamah (رضي الله عنه) — jo Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke sote bete the — ne bayan farmaya:\n\n\Jab Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) par yeh aayat nazil hui:\n\n*'Allah to bas yeh chahta hai ke tumse Rijs (naapaaki) door kar de...'* (Surah Al-Ahzab"
"3205","## Scholarly Roman Urdu Translation:\n\nIbn Abi 'Umar ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan ne Dawud ibn Abi Hind se riwayat ki, Dawud ne al-Sha'bi se riwayat ki, aur al-Sha'bi ne Masruq se riwayat ki. Masruq ne farmaya:\n\nHazrat 'Ā'ishah (رضی اللہ عنہا) ne yādi karke yeh āyat tilāwat farmai: *\Jis din zamein ko doosri zamein badal diyā jāyegā\""* (Sūrah Ibrāhīm"
"3206","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allahu Anha) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Agar Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ko kuch bhi chhipana hota jo un par wahi (divine revelation) ki gayi thi"
"3207","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke: \Agar Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallim) se kuch wahi (revelation) chhupaya jaata"
"3208","Hazrat Ibn Umar (Razi Allah Unhu) ne farmaya: \Hum Zaid bin Harithah (Razi Allah Unhu) ko sirf 'Zaid bin Muhammad' hi pukarte thay"
"3209","Hazrat Dawud bin Abi Hind rivayet karte hain ki Hazrat Sha'bi (Rah.) ne Allah Ta'ala ke irshad: \Muhammad (Sallallahu Alayhi Wasallam) tumhare mardon ke koi ke baap nahi hain\"" (Surah Al-Ahzab"
"3210","Umm-e-Umarah Al-Ansariyyah (رضي الله عنها) se marwi hai ke unhone Nabi-e-Akram (ﷺ) ke paas aakar farmaya: \Mujhe to kuch nazar nahi aata magar sab kuch mardon ke liye hai.\"""""
"3211","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat farmaya: \Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Aur tu ne apne mein chhupa rakha tha jo Allah karne wala tha... (33:37)' - yeh Hazrat Zainab bint Jahsh (Razi Allah unha) ke mutaalliq thi.\"""""
"3212","Hadees ka riwayat karte hain Anas (Razi Allah un se) ne:\n\n\Jab Zainab bint Jahsh (Razi Allah un se) ke mutalliq yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Jab Zaid ne us se apna matlab poora kar liya...'\"""""
"3213","Umm Hani bint Abu Talib (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat farmaya: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne mujh se nikah ka irada farmaya...\"""""
"3214","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marfoo' tariq se riwayat hai: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke liye har qisam ki auratain haram kar di gayin"
"3215","Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) rwayt krty hyn: \rswl allh (ﷺ) ka dnya kw nhyn rhay yhan tk kh an kay lyay awrtwn kw hlal kr dya gya۔\"""""
"3216","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne riwayat kiya, Abu Tumaylah ne riwayat kiya, al-Zubayr ibn Junadah se, Ibn Buraydah se, unke father (Sahabi) se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jab hum Bayt al-Maqdis pahunche"
"3217","**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\n**Riwayat:** Al-Ja'd bin Abi 'Uthman ne Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat ki:\n\n\Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne nikah farmaya...\"""""
"3218","Hadees ka Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) apni ek zawja ke paas the.\"""""
"3219","Abu Mas'ud Al-Ansari (رضي الله عنه) ne rivaayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) humaare paas aaye jab hum Sa'd bin Ubadah (رضي الله عنه) ki mehfil mein baithay thay. Bashir bin Sa'd (رضي الله عنه) ne kaha ke Allah Ta'ala ne humein hukum diya hai ke aap par durood padhein."
"3220","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bay shk mwsyٰ (alyh alslam) nay kha:"""
"3221","Farwah bin Musaik Al-Muradi (رضي الله عنہ) ne kaha: \Main Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: 'Ya Rasoolullah! Kya main apni qaum walon se un logon se na lujhoon jo (Islam se) mu pherte hain?'\"""""
"3222","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jb allh taalyٰ aasman pr ksy bat ka fyslh frmata hay"""
"3223","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne bayan farmaya: \n\Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath the...\"""""
"3224","Qutaybah ne hamse riwayat ki, Yaḥyā ibn Zakariyyā ibn Abī Zāʾidah ne riwayat ki, Dāwūd ibn Abī Hind se, ʿIkrimah se, Ibn ʿAbbās (رضي الله عنهما) se, unhone farmāyā: Quraysh ne Yahūd se kahā, \Hamen kuchh aisi bāt batāo jis se is ādmī se ham sawāl karein.\"" Unhon ne kahā"
"3225","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh: \bnw slmh kay mkan mdynh mnwrh ky srhdwn pr waqa thay۔\"""""
"3226","Abu Dharr (rzy allh anh) khtay hyn: \myn msjd myn dakhl hwa jb swrj ghrwb hw chka tha۔\"""""
"3227","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw bhy pkarnay wala ksy chyz ky trf blata hay tw wh as kay sath rwka jata hay۔\"""""
"3228","Ubayy bin Ka'b (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \n\Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se Allah Ta'ala ki is baare mein sawaal kiya...\"""""
"3229","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Abd ibn Humayd ne humein riwayat ki:** Sulayman ibn Dawud ne riwayat ki, Shu'bah se, Abu Bishr se, Sa'eed ibn Jubayr se — aur unhone Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنہ) ka zikr nahi kiya — aur Hushaym ne, Abu Bishr se, Sa'eed ibn Jubayr se, Ibn 'abbas (رضي الله عنہ) se, Allah Ta'ala ke kalame shareef ke muta'alliq:\n\n> **\Apni namaz mein zor se mat padho\""** (Surah Al-Isra"
"3230","Samurah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Sam Arab ke pidar the.\"""""
"3231","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Ibn Abi 'Umar ne riwayat ki, unhone Sufyan se riwayat ki, unhone Mis'ar se riwayat ki, unhone 'Asim ibn Abi an-Najud se riwayat ki, unhone Zirr ibn Hubaysh se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya:**\n\nMain ne **Hudhayfah ibn al-Yamān** (raziya Allahu 'anhim) se kya: \Kya Rasoolullah ﷺ ne **Bayt al-Maqdis** (Jerusalem) mein namaz padhi?\""\n\nUnhone farmaya: **\""Nahi.\""**\n\nMain ne kaha: **\""Balki unhone zaroor padhi!\""**\n\nUnhone farmaya: **\""Kya tum yeh kehte ho"
"3232","Abu Qilabah ne Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Raat ke waqt...\"""""
"3233","# Hadith ka Tarjuma – Ilmi Roman Urdu mein\n\n**Ibn Abi 'Umar ne riwayat ki, woh Sufyan se, woh 'Amr ibn Dinar se, woh Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, unhone kaha:**\n\nMaine Ibn 'Abbas (Razi Allahu Anhuma) se kaha: \Beshak an-Nawf al-Bikali yeh da'wa karte hain ke Musa (Musa Alaihis Salaam)"
"3234","Hazrat Mu'adh bin Jabal (Razi Allahu Anho) se riwayat hai ke: \Ek subah...\"""""
"3235","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zuhair (raz.) se riwayat hai ke unke father ne farmaya: \Jab aayat nazil hui: 'Then...'\"""""
"3236","Asma bint Yazid (raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: \Main ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko padhte suna: 'Farmao: \""Aey mere un bandon ne jo apne nafs par zulm kar chuke hain! Allah ki rehmat se mayoos na ho jao.\""'\"""""
"3237","Hazrat Abdullah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh ayk yhwdy nby krym (ﷺ) ky khdmt myn hazr hwa awr arz krnay lga: \aay mhmd! allh taalyٰ aasmanwn kw ayk angly pr athayay ga۔\"""""
"3238","Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Toh Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne hairat aur ta'eed mein hansi daal di.\"""""
"3239","Abū Sa‘īd al-Ashajj aur Abū Mūsā Muḥammad ibn al-Muthannā ne hamāre hāṅ ḥadīth bayān kī, dono ne farmāyā: Ibn Idrīs ne hamāre hāṅ ḥadīth bayān kī, apne wālid se, Simāk ibn Ḥarb se, ‘Alqamah ibn Wā’il se, aur Mughīrah ibn Shu‘bah (raḍiya Allāhu ‘anhu) se, unhone farmāyā:\n\nRasūl Allāh (ṣallallāhu ‘alayhi wa sallam) ne mujhe Najrān bhejā. Unhon ne mujh se kiyā: “Kyā tum apne Kitāb meṅ ‘Yā ukht Hārūn’ (Sūrah Maryam, 19:28) nahiṅ paṛhte, hālāṅkī ‘Īsā (‘alayhi al-salām) aur Mūsā (‘alayhi al-salām) ke darmiyān bahut lambā zamānā guzar chukā thā?” Mujhe is kā javāb nahīṅ āyā. Main Rasūl Allāh (ṣallallāhu ‘alayhi wa sallam) ke pās wāpas āyā aur unheṅ ittilā‘ dī. Unhon ne farmāyā: “Tum unheṅ kyā batā nahīṅ diyā ke woh apne ambiyā aur pahle ke ṣāliḥīn ke nām par apne bachchoṅ ke nām rakhte the?”\n\nAbū ‘Īsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ gharīb ḥadīth hai; ham ise sirf Ibn Idrīs ke riwāyat ke siwā nahīṅ jānte."
"3240","Mujahid ne riwayat ki ke Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne farmaya: \Kya tum jaante ho Jahannam ki chaahati kya hai?\"" Maine kaha: \""Nahi.\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Haan.\"""""
"3241","Masruq (rz all an) ne riwayat ki ke Aisha (rz all ana) ne farmaya: \n\Aye Rasoolullah (sly allh alyh wslm)! qyamt kay dn allh taalyٰ apnay hath say sary zmyn kw pkr lay ga awr aasmanwn kw apnay dayyn hath myn lpyt lay ga (swrh alzmr، aayt 67)۔ as wqt mwmnyn khan hwn gay؟\"" \naap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""srat pr، aay aayshh!\"""""
"3242","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Main kaise chain se baith sakta hoon jabke Soor waale ne apni honton mein Soor liya hua hai aur uska maathe aage jhuka hua hai?\"""""
"3243","**Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Razi Allah un se khush ho) ne riwayat ki ke:** \nEk neem-ahli (badwi) ne kaha: *“Ya Rasool Allah! As-Sur kya hai?”* \nAap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: *“Woh ek soor (horn) hai jismein phoonka jaata hai.”*"
"3244","Muḥammad ibn Bashshār ne hamse riwāyat kī: Yaḥyā ibn Saʿīd ne hamse riwāyat kī: Shuʿbah ne hamse riwāyat kī, al-Suddī se, Murrah se, ʿAbdullāh ibn Masʿūd (رضي الله عنه) se, āyat ke bāb mein: *\Aur tum mein se koi aisa nahin jo us (Jahannam) par guzarne wāla na ho\""* (Qurʾān 19:71). Unhon ne farmāyā: \""Woh us par guzreṅge"
"3245","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ek pukarne wala pukarega: 'Tum hamesha zinda rahoge aur kabhi nahi maroge; tum hamesha tandurust rahoge aur kabhi bimar nahi hoge; tum hamesha jawan rahoge aur kabhi budhe nahi hoge; tum hamesha ne'mat mein rahoge aur kabhi tangi nahi hogi.' Ye Allah Ta'ala ka farman hai: Ye jannat hai.\"""""
"3246","Nu'man bin Bashir (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi-e-Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Du'a hi ibaadat hai.\"" Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tilawat ki: \""Aur tumhare Rabb ne farmaya: 'Mujh se pukaro…'\"""""
"3247","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu Anhu) se marwi hai:**\n\nJab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Khyber se wapas aaye, to raat ki safar karte rahe. Jab neend ne un par ghalib aa gayi, to unhon ne utar kar raat ke liye araam farmaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: **\Aye Bilal! Humare liye raat ki hifaazat kar.\""**\n\nBilal (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne namaz padhi"
"3248","**Abdullah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay:**\n\n\myn kabh kay chadr kay nychay chhpa hwa tha۔\"""""
"3249","Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay tlawt frmayy: \bay shk jw lwg khtay hyn kh hmara rb allh hay\"""""
"3250","Hazrat Tawus ne riwayat farmaya: Hazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se is aayat ka matlab poocha gaya: \Aap farma dijiye: 'Maine is (tabligh-e-risaalat) ke badle mein tum se koi ujrat nahi maangi"
"3251","Ubaidullah bin Al-Wazi ne riwayat ki ek Shaikh se jo Banu Murrah se thay, unhone mujhe bayan kiya keh..."
"3252","Abu Umamah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \kwyy qwm hdayt mlnay kay bad gmrah nhyn hwty mgr as kay bad kh an myn jhgra pyda hw jayay۔\"""""
"3253","**Hadith ka tarjuma (scholaranah Roman Urdu mein):**\n\nMasruq (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke: \nEk shakhs Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha: \Ek qissa go (story teller) ne kaha hai ke zameen se ek dhuwaan (smoke) niklega.\"""""
"3254","Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Koi momin nahi magar uske do darwaze hain: ek darwaza jis se uske aamaal buland kiye jaate hain...\"""""
"3255","Hazrat Abdul-Malik bin Umair ne riwayat kiya, Abdullah bin Salam ke sar nepeche walon ne kaha: \Jab log Uthman (radiyallahu anhu) ke peechhe ho gaye\"""""
"3256","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat farmaya: \Jab Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) baadal dekhte to idhar udhar chalte phirte. Aur jab baarish hoti"""
"3257","Hazrat Sha'bi (rhmth allh alyh) nay rwayt ky kh hzrt alqmh (rhmth allh alyh) nay frmaya: myn nay hzrt abn msawd (rzy allh anh) say kha۔"
"3258","# Tarjama-e-Hadith\n\n**Abd ibn Humayd ne humein riwayat ki:** Rawh ibn 'Ubadah ne humein riwayat ki, unho ne Sa'id se, unho ne Qatadah se, unho ne Anas ibn Mālik (radhi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat ki ke **al-Rubayyi' bint al-Naḍr** Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aayin, jin ke bete **Ḥārithah ibn Surāqah** ko Yaum-e-Badr mein ek teer-e-khataa ne maar liya tha. Woh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aayin aur kaha:\n\n*\Mujhe Ḥārithah ke baare mein bataaiye. Agar us ne khair haasil ki hai"
"3259","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Ibn Abi 'Umar ne riwayat ki, unhone Sufyan se riwayat ki, unhone Malik ibn Mihwal se riwayat ki, unhone Abd ar-Rahman ibn Sa'id ibn Wahb al-Hamdani se riwayat ki, ke Aa'izah (Allah un se razi ho), Nabi ﷺ ki biwi ne farmaya:**\n\n\Maine Rasool Allah ﷺ se is aayat ke baare mein poocha: *'Aur woh log jo dete hain jo dete hain"
"3260","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya: \nSahaba-e-Kiram (رضي الله عنهم) mein se baaz logon ne arz ki: \n\Aey Allah ke Rasool (ﷺ)! Ye woh log hain jinka zikr Allah Ta'ala ne apni kitaab mein kiya hai?\"""""
"3261","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Ilmi Roman Urdu mein)\n\n**Abd ibn Humayd ne humein riwayat ki:** Rawh ibn 'Ubaydah ne humein riwayat ki, 'Ubaydullah ibn al-Akhnas se, unhone mujhe khabar di: 'Amr ibn Shu'ayb ne mujhe riwayat ki, apne baap se, aur unke baap ne apne daada se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya:\n\nEk aadmi tha jiska naam **Marthad ibn Abi Marthad** tha, woh Makkah se qaidi utha kar Madinah Munawwara le jaata tha. Unhone kaha: Makkah mein ek badkaar aurat thi jiska naam **'Anaq** thi, woh unki saathi thi. Usne Makkah ke ek qaidi se wadaa kiya tha ke usko utha lega (nijaat ke liye).\n\nUnhone kaha: Main aaya jab ke Makkah ki ek deewaar ki chaanv mein chaandni raat thi. Unhone kaha: Phir 'Anaq aayi aur usne meri deewaar ke paas meri saaye ki andheri dekhi. Jab woh mere paas pahunchi, usne pehchaan liya aur boli, \Marthad?\"" Maine kaha"
"3262","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allah unho se khush ho) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Jab Rasool Allah (ﷺ) Hudaibiyyah se wapas aa rahe thoh un par wahi nazil hui.\"""""
"3263","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anhu) se riwayat hai ke Assr Subh ki namaz ke dauraan At-Tan'im pahadiyon se aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath aasman phar kar sath 